<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="EXO" style="id">Peikhietna</book>
  <para style="h">Peikhietna</para>
  <para style="toc1">Peikhietna</para>
  <para style="toc2">Peikhietna</para>
  <para style="mt">Peikhietna</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tam teng pen Jacob tawh Egypt gama a zawhton, a innkuon ciet utawh ahi Israel’ tapate’ min ahi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Reuben, Simeon, Levi, le Judah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Isschar, Zebulun, le Benjamin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Dan le Naphtali, Gad le Asher-te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jacob pana a pieng zosie a unpi-in sawm sagi a pha hi. Joseph pen Egypt gamah a na om zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ciengin Joseph, a sanggamte zosie, le tua khangmi zosie a si sieng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahi vangin Israel-te cipha-in tampi a pha uhi; amate tamin hat citahin a hat vua, tuaci’n gam sung teng a dim uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tu-in Egypt gamah Joseph a thei lo kumpi khat a khang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama in a mite kungah, “En un, Israel mite ei sangin tam zaw-in zong a thahat zaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hing pei un, pilvang tahin amate bawl vai, tua banga i bawl sih leh amate ang pung ding a, gal le sa hing om leh ei do dingin i galte ang pawl ding vua, i gam panin ang taimang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin thona-aana sepsahna tawh amate a gawt dingin a tung vuah nasem uhte a koi uhi. Amate in Pharaoh adingin ankholna khuopite ahi, Pithom le Rameses-te a lam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hinanle a kibawlsiet ciengin amate tampi pha semsemin a kizelthang zaw vua, tuaci’n Egypt-te in Israel-te giing mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Egypt-te in Israel-te na semsahin a gawgam mama vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />buoncil nasep le a hamsa tehlei bawl nasep le lolai-a nasep namkim tawh a hinkhuo uh a genthei sah uhi. A sepsahna zosie vuah amate a gawgam mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Egypt kumpipa in Hebrew naudomte, khat’ min Shiphrah, le adang khat’ min Puah a kicite kungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Hebrew numeite nau na dop ciengun nausuona topha tungah a to nausen en unlen, tapa ahile that un; tanu ahileh na hinkhawi ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahi vangin naudomte in Pasien a giing uhi; amate in Egypt kumpipa thupieh mang loin nausen pasalte a hinkhawi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuaci’n Egypt kumpipa in naudomte hlansahin amate kungah, “Bang dinga tam bang na na sep vua, nausen pasalte na hinkhawi uh ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Naudomte in Pharaoh kungah, “Hebrew numeite pen Egypt numeite tawh kibang lo hi; bang ding ahei cile amate a thahat mama vua, naudomte tun masangin a na suoh zo ta uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Pasien in naudomte a limbawl hi; tuale mite pungin a thahat mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Naudomte in Pasien a giin ziehun amate tungah Pasien in innkuonte a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua ciengin Pharaoh in ama’ mite zosie thupie a, “Hebrew-te sung panin a pieng tapa zosie Nile gun sungah na pai ding vua, ahi vangin tanu kici popo na hinkhawi ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu-in Levi’ suonte khat pei-in Levi numei khat zi-in a la hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua numei gai-in tapa khat a nei hi; ama in a deihuoi nausenno khat ahi hi, ci-a a mu ciengin tua nausen hla thum sung a phuol hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in nausen a phuol zawh nawn lo ciengin pumpeng tawh kiphan law khat bawlin suong meihol nai le singnai tawh a zut hi; tua nu in law sungah nausen sielin gun gei-a pumpeng nawng lahah a koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama bang ang kilaw ei ci a thei nadingin a gamla mun khatah a sanggamnu a ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A kisil dingin Pharaoh’ tanu gunah a peisuh a, a nasemte gun gei-ah a vah uhi. Pharaoh’ tanu in pumpeng lahah law khat mu a, tua law a la dingin a nasem nu khat a sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in tua law a hon ciengin nausen mu hi. Tua nausen a kap hi. Ama in nausen a khuotuo a, “Tam pen Hebrew tate lahah khat hi ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ciengin a sanggamnu in Pharaoh’ tanu kungah, “ Kei va pei-in Hebrew numeite lahah naucing ding mi khat kang suipieh diei mah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pharaoh’ tanu in ama kungah, “Hoi hi, va sui ta’n,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n ama kuonin a nausen’ nu hlan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pharaoh’ tanu in ama kungah, “Tami nausen la inlen kei adingin ei keppieh in, na thaman kang pie ding hi,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n tua numei in nausen la-in a kem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua nausen a gol ciengin ama in Pharaoh’ tanu kungah a peipi a, tuaci’n ama’ ta dingin a la hi. Ama in tua nausen’ min Moses hisah hi. Azieh pen ama in, “Tui sung panin ama ka kaikhie hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ni khat, Moses a gol zaw ciengin a mite kungah pei-in a thona-aana a septe uh a mu hi. Egypt mi khat in a sanggam Hebrew mi khat a sat ama in mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama khuodah kawikawi a, mi koima mu lo ahi ziehin tua Egypt mipa thatin senel lahah a phuol hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A zing ni-a ang peikia ciengin ama in a kihau Hebrew mi ni a mu hi; a khielpa kungah, “Bang dinga na guolpa na vuoh ahiei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama in dawng a, “Ko tungah vaihawm thukhen dingin nang koi pen’ ang se ahiei? Egypt mipa na tha bangin kei ei tha sawm na hi amah?” a ci hi. Tua bepin Moses in, “Ka silbawl ei kithei hi ta,” ci-in ngaisunin a zau hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pharaoh in tua thu a zah ciengin Moses tha dingin a sui hi. Ahi vangin Pharaoh kung panin Moses a taimang hi. Midian gamah tengin tuikhuh gei khatah a to hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Midian siempu pa in tanu sagi nei hi. Tui tawi dingin a pei vua, a pa uh’ ganhingte dawn dingin a tui-um te a dim uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahi vangin tuucing pawlkhat pei-in amate a notmang uhi. Moses ding to-in amate a hu a, a tuuhonte uh tui a piehpieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A pa Reuel kungah a tun ciengun, “A bangci-a tuni-a hing hici tun bai na hi vuoi?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amate in, “Egypt mipa khat in tuucingte khut sung panin ei hunkhie a, ko adingin tui nangawn ei tawipiehin tuuhonte zongtui ei piehpieh hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama in a tanute kungah, “Ama hei sungah a om ei? Bang dinga tua mipa nang nuasie uh ahiei? An nehpi dingin va hlan ta un,” ci-in a sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua mipa tawh opton ding Moses thukim a, tua pa in a tanu Zipporah tawh Moses a kinungsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua nu in tapa khat nei a, a min Gershom a phuo hi. Azieh pen ama in, “Kei gamdanga teng pemta ka hi ta hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hun sawtpi zaw ciengin Egypt kumpipa a si hi. A saltanna ziehun Israel-te kapin mau-in kiko uhi. A saltanna panun huna ngenin a kikona uh Pasien kung a tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Pasien in a tauna uh za a, Abraham, Isaac, le Jacob tawh a thuciemna a phawh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Pasien in Israel-te a en a, tuale Pasien in amate a phawh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Moses in Midian-te’ siempu ahi a sungpa Jethro’ tuuhonte a cing hi. Ama in gamlah nitumna lamah a tuute peipi a, Pasien’ muol Horeb a tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khum mun sawlbawh lah meikuong sung panin ama kungah Topa’ vantungmi kilang hi; ama in a et leh tua sawlbawh kuong a, hinanle a katum sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ciengin Moses in, “Kei va pei-in tami ka sil mu lamdang ka en ding a, bang dinga sawlbawh katum lo ahei ci ka va kan ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A en dinga ama a peina Topa in a mu bepin Pasien in sawlpang kawm panin ama hlan a, “Moses, Moses!” ci hi. Ama in, “Tanah om ing,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in, “Ei nai sin! Na kenga na kedapte sutdawh in, azieh pen tua na dinna mun khu mun siengtho ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in, “Keima in na pa’ Pasien, Abraham’ Pasien, Isaac’ Pasien, le Jacob’ Pasien ka hi hi,” a cibe lai hi. Moses in Pasien a et ngam lo ziehin a mai a hum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in, “Egypt gama ka mite thuoh gimna ka mu zo ta hi; amate tunga nasem uhte ziehin keima in a kikona uh aw ka za zo hi. A thuoh uh gimnate ka thei a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Egypt-te khut sung panin amate a hunkhie ding le khum gam panin a hoi a tanzau leitang, bawngnawi le khuoizu a luonna leitang, Canaan-te, Hit-te, Amor-te, Perez-te, Hiv-te le Jebus-te’ opna munah amate a peipi dingin kang peisuh zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tu-in ka kungah Israel-te kikona ang tung zo a, Egypt-te in amate a gawtna ka mu zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuaci’n hing pei-in Egypt panin ka mi Israel-te a peipi dingin Pharaoh kungah kang sawl ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahi vangin Moses in Pasien kungah, “Kei koi ka hi a, Pharaoh kungah pei-in Egypt panin Israel-te va peipi ta ding ka hei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama in, “Nangma tawh kang omton ding hi; tami khu nangma ang sawl keima ka hina lim hi ding hi: Egypt panin Israel-te na peipi zaw ciengin tami muol tungah Pasien na bie ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahi vangin Moses in Pasien kungah, “Israel-te kungah pei inlen amate kungah, ‘Na pate uh’ Pasien in na kung vuah ei sawl hi,’ vaci taleng amate in, ’A min bang ahei?’ ci-in ei dong uleh amate kungah bang ka gen ta diei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pasien in Moses kungah, “ KEIMA AHI KEIMA ka hi hi,” a ci hi. Ama in, “Israel-te kungah, ‘ KEIMA a kici pa in na kung vuah keima ei sawl hi,’ ci-in tam bangin na gen ding hi,” a cibe lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pasien in zong Moses kungah, “Tam bangin Israel-te kungah, ‘ Topa , na pate uh’ Pasien, Abraham’ Pasien, Isaac’ Pasien, le Jacob’ Pasien in na kung vuah kei ei sawl hi,’ na ci ding uhi: Tam pen keima min’ hi tawntung ding a, tam pen khang tawntungin ei kilawna hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pei-in Israel upate khawm inlen a kung vuah, “ Topa , na pu na pate uh’ Pasien, Abraham’ Pasien, Isaac’ Pasien le Jacob’ Pasien keima tungah ang kilah zo hi. Egypt gam sungah na tung vua ang kibawlna ka mu zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Egypt’ gimna panin Canaan-te, Hit-te, Amor-te, Perez-te, Hiv-te le Jebus-te’ leitang, bawngnawi le khuoizu luonna leitangah note kang peipito ding hi,’ ci hi,” va ci ta’n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amate in na thu ang ngai ding uhi; tuale Egypt kumpipa kungah nang le Israel upate pei-in ama kungah, “ Topa ahi Hebrew mite’ Pasien in kote ei kimupi zo hi; ka Pasien uh ahi Topa tungah biehna ka lui thei nadingun ni thum peina gamlahah ei peisah in,’ va ci ta un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hizongle khut thahat khat’ paubawlna longal tawh Egypt kumpipa in note ang peisah lo ding lam ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuaci’n ka khut zahin tua sunga ka bawl ding na lamdangte tawh Egypt-te ka vatmai ding hi; tua zaw ciengin ama in note ang peisah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Keima in Egypt-te muna-ah tam mihingte maipha ka pie ding hi. Na pei ciengun khut guoh tawh na pei sih ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />numei a kici poma in a vengte le a inn sunga zintungte kung panin ngun le kham tawh kibawl kizepnate le puonsil nihtente a ngen ding vua, na tapate le na tanute na silsah ding uhi; tua bangin note in Egypt-te’ van na lahpieh ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin Moses in, “Ahi vangin amate in kei ei tahsang loin ahi sihle ka thu ei ngai sih hinlen, ‘Nangma kungah Topa hing kilaa sih,’ ei ci mawh uleh bang ka law ta diei?” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa in ama kungah, “Na khut sunga khu bang ahiei?” a ci hi. Ama in, “Ciengkhut,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuale ama in, “Tua khu tuolah sep vawi,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n ama in tua ciengkhut tuolah a sep leh gul khat a suoh hi; tuale ama kung panin Moses a nuakin hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in Moses kungah, “Na khut zah inlen tua gul a mei-ah man in,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n a khut zahin gulpi a man le ama’ khut sungah ciengkhut khat a suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Tuaci’n amate in a tahsan thei nadingun nangma kungah Topa , a Pasien uh ahi Abraham’ Pasien, Isaac’ Pasien le Jacob’ Pasien ang kilangzo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa in ama kungah, “Na puontuol kawmah na khut koi in,” khatvei a cikia hi. Ama in a puontuol kawmah a khut a koi hi; ama in a khut a lah ciengin a khut phah gawp a, vua bangin a ngo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ciengin Pasien in, “Na puontuol kawmah na khut koikia vawi,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n ama in a puontuol kawmah a khut koikia-in a khut a lakia leh a tahsa ngai ma bangin a omkia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Amate in nang ang tahsan sih vua, ahi sihle lim masa pen a thudon sih phiel ule zong lim nukhia pen tahsang kha thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tami lim ni tegel nangawn tahsang loin ang thudon sih uleh Nile gun panin tui halkhat la-in lei gawta lahah na sung ding hi; tuale Nile gun pana na lah ding tui pen lei gawta tungah sisan a suoh ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahi vangin Moses in Topa kungah, “Ka Topa aw, tu masie ahi a, na sila pa nei hopi tu mama nangawnin ahi zongin kei mi dangnal ka hi ngai vawt sih hi; a muon ham vahuot le a lei awhpi ka hi bo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in ama kungah, “Mihingte kam koi pieh ahiei? Koi in amate hamsah thei lo, ahi sihle bil bingsah, khuo musah, ahi sihle mit tawsah ahei? Topa , ahi keima’ bawl hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tu-in kuon inlen na kam tawh kang om ding a, na thugen ding kang hil ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hinanle ama in, “Ka Topa aw, hing thum ing, midang khat sawl zaw in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ciengin Moses tungah Topa a sin so a, ama in, “Levi mi na sanggampa Aaron om hi lo amah? Ama in hoitahin thu a gen thei lam ka thei hi; tu nangawnin nang ang dawn dingin ama ang pei a, nangma ang mu ciengin a lung a nuom ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nang in ama hopi-in a kam sungah thu na muom ding hi; nangma’ kam le ama’ kam tawh keima kang om ding a, na sep na bawl ding uh kang hil ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama in mite tungah nang adingin thu a gen ding hi; ama pen nang adingin na kamin ang pang ding a, nang zong ama adingin a Pasien bangin na pang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na khut sungah tami ciengkhut tawi inlen, tua tawh limte na bawl ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A sungpa Jethro kungah Moses peikia-in a kungah, “Hing thum ing, Egypt gama ka unaute a hing lai uh amah, a en dingin amate kungah ei hawsah in,” a ci hi. Tuale Jethro in Moses kungah, “Lungnuom tahin pei in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Midian gam sungah Topa in Moses kungah, “Egypt gamah peikia in; azieh pen nangma ang tha sawm mi zosie si sieng zo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuaci’n Moses in a zi le a tapate a la a, laa tung khatah amate tuongsahin Egypt gamah a peikia uhi; tuale Moses in a khut sungah Pasien’ ciengkhut a tawi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Topa in Moses kungah, “Egypt gamah na peikia ciengin Pharaoh mai-ah na sep thei dinga kang piehsa na lamdang zosie na bawl ding thei gige in; ahi vangin keima in a lungtang ka khausah ding a, tuaci’n mite a peisah sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua ciengin nangma in Pharaoh kungah, ‘ Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Israel ka tapa a tapen ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Keima nang kungah, “Ama in kei ei bieh thei nadingin ka tapa peisah in,” kang ci hi. Ahi vangin nang in ama a pei ding na phal sih hi; tu-in keima in na tapa a tapen pa ka that ding hi,’ vaci ta’n,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Lamkal mun khatah amate a zan gie vua, Topa in Moses na dawnin ama tha ding a na hanciem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahi vangin Zipporah in suonghiem khat la-in a tapa’ tep tanpieh a, tua tawh Moses’ keng thamin, “A mantahin nang pen kei tungah sisan tawh ka mopa na hi hi!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama guohin a omsah hi. Tua ciengin ama in, “Teptanna hangin sisan tawh ka mopa na hi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Topa in Aaron kungah, “Moses dawn dingin gamlahah pei in,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n ama a pei hi; tuale ama in Pasien’ muolah ama mu-in a nam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Topa in ama a sawlna thu zosie le a bawl dinga a sawl limte zosie Moses in Aaron kungah a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tua ciengin Moses le Aaron pei-in Israel upate a unpi-in a kaikhawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Aaron in Moses kungah Topa gensa thu zosie a unpi-in a gen a, mite muna-ah limte a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Mite in a um uhi; Topa in Israel-te a thudon lam za-in, a gentheina uh a mu lam a thei ciengun amate kunin Pasien a bie uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua zaw ciengin Pharaoh kungah Moses le Aaron a pei vua, “Israel Pasien Topa in, ‘Senel gama kei kungah pawi khat a bawl thei nadingun ka mite peisah in,’ ci hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ahi vangin Pharaoh in, “Ama thugen mangin Israel-te ka peisah na valia dingin Topa kici pa khu koi ahiei? Tua Topa ka thei kha vawt sih a, Israel-te zong ka peisah sih ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate in, “Ka kung vuah Hebrew-te’ Pasien ang kihil hi; Topa ka Pasien uh tungah biehpiehna ka lui thei nadingun ni thum khuolzinna senel gamah kote ei peisah in, tua ahi sihle ama in kote tungah pulnatna ahi sihle namsau ang tungsah ding hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahi vangin Egypt kumpipa in ama gel kungah, “Moses le Aaron aw, bang dinga mite na sem thei lo-a na koi gel ahei? Na nasep uh kisep khinkhian lel un!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pharaoh in a thugen zom a, “Tu-in gam mite sangin amate a tamzaw ta vua, hizongle amate nasep na khawlsah nuom lai uhi!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pharaoh in khum ni ma-in nasem uhte le nasem vante thu pie a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Masang lai bangin mite tungah tehlei bawl nading butu na pie nawn sih ding uhi; Peisah unlen amate ding butu khawmsah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahi vangin amate kungah masang lai-a a tehlei khenza ma na ngen ding uhi; a khen za ding uh khiem sih un, bangzieh ahei cile amate mi thada ahi uhi; tua ziehin amate in, “Ka Pasien uh kungah biehpiehna ka bawl thei nadingun ei peisah in,’ ci-in a kiko uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amate tungah nasep a hamsa zaw suon un; tua hile amate nasep kitahla-in zuou thu kigente a don ta sih ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuaci’n nasem uhte le mite’ nasep vante pei-in mite kungah, “Pharaoh in, ‘Butu kang pie ta sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pei unlen na sui thei theina vuah kisui tawm ta un. Ahi vangin na nasep uh themkhat mama kikhiem lo ding hi,’ ci hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaci’n butu tangin hampa khawm dingin Egypt gam zosie-ah mite a kikhenzah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nasem uhte in kin ngaisutin, “Butu ang kipieh lai ma bangin nisiela nasep ding za ma uh zo un,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pharaoh’ nasem uhte in Israel nasep vante kisat gawpin, “Bang dinga masang lam bangin zani le tuni-a man dinga ang kipie tehlei bawl zo lo na hi uh ahei?” ci-in amate kidong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ciengin Israel’ nasep vante pei-in Pharaoh kungah, “Bang dinga na nasemte tam banga na bawl tah lawm ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na nasemte butu ei kipie sih a, ahi vangin amate in ka kung vuah, ‘Tehlei bawl un!’ ei ci uhi. Na nasemte ei kisat dan en vawi! Na mite tungah na thuman sih hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama in, “Note na thasie uhi, na thasie uhi; tua ahi ziehin, “Pasien kungah biehna pie dingin ei peisah in,’ na ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tu-in pei unlen na sem un. Azieh pen butu ang kipie sih ding a, hizongle tehlei a mal ngaina za ma na bawl veve ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amate in, “Ni sima na tehlei seh za uh khiem lo ding,” a ci ciengun Israel’ nasep vante in thu hamsa a tuo lam a kithei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Pharaoh kung panin a pei ciengun amate dawn dinga a na ngah Moses le Aaron tawh a kimu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amate in, “ Topa in note hing enin thu hing khen taheh! Bangzieh ahei cile Pharaoh le a nasemte muna-ah ko a khiel nei suohsah vua, ko tha nadingin a khut sung vuah namsau khat na koi uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa lamah Moses kihei kia-in,” Topa aw, bang dinga tam mite na bawlsiet ahei? Bang dinga kei nei sawl gumsan ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Pharaoh kungah na min tawh thu gen dinga ka pei masah lai-a kipanin ama in tam mite a bawlsie zo hi. Nang in na mite suotah nading bangma na bawl vawt sih hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in Moses kung ah, “Tu-in Pharaoh tunga ka bawl ding na mu ding hi: Ama in a vanglien khut tawh amate a peisah valon ding hi; ama in a vanglien khut khat tawh a gam sung panin amate a notmang ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pasien in zong Moses hopi-in ama tungah tam bangci hi: “Keima Topa ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Abraham, Isaac le Jacob-te tungah Vanglien Pasien-in ka kilang a, ahi vangin amate kungah ka min Topa ci-in ka kitheisah sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Keima in pemta bangin a tenna uh Canaan leitang pieh dingin amate tawh thuciemna ka kipsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Keima in Egypt-te khut sungah saltang Israel-te’ mauna aw zong ka za zo a, ka kamciemna ka phawh zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Israel-te kungah, “Keima Topa ka hi hi. Keima in Egypt-te’ vangih panin note kang hla ding a, amau’ sila hina panin kang suohta sah ding hi. Keima in a thahat a kizah ban le thukhenna nasep lien tawh kang tan ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Keima’ mi dingin note kang la ding a, na Pasien uh ka hi ding hi. Egypt mite’ vangih pana a suohta sah, Topa ka hina uh note in na thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Keima in Abraham, Isaac, le Jacob-te tungah pieh dinga ka ciemsa leitangah note kang peipi ding a, na luo dingun tua leitang kang pie ding hi. Keima in Topa ka hi hi,’ ci-un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Moses in Israel-te kungah tam thu a gen hi. Ahi vangin a lungsim uh a kitapzanna le a gimsie a saltanna ziehun amate in Moses’ thugen a ngai sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in Moses kungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Pei inlen a gam panin Israel-te a peisah nadingin Egypt kumpipa Pharaoh kungah va gen ta’n,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahi vangin Moses in Topa hopi a, “Israel-te in ka thugen a ngai sih uhi; tua ahi ziehin a dangnal lo kei thugen bangci bangin Pharaoh in ei ngai ding ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tam bangin Egypt kumpipa Pharaoh le Israel-te tungtang thu Topa in Moses le Aaron hopi a, Egypt gam panin Israel-te a hla nadingun amate thu a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tam teng pen amahaw’ be lutangte ahi uhi: Israel’ tapa tapen Reuben’ tapate: Hanoch, Pallu, Hezron, le Carmi ahi hi; tam teng pen Reuben’ innkuonte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Simeon tapate: Jemuel, Jamin, Ohad, Jachin, Zohar, le Canaan numei‘ tapa shaul ahi hi; tam teng pen Simeon’ innkuonte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tam teng pen a khang utawh kizui-in Levi tapate’ min ahi hi: Gershon, Kohath, le Merari ahi a, Levi kum za le kum sawmthum le sagi a hing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Gershon tapate: amate’ innkuon ciet tawh kizui-in Libni le Shimei ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kohath’ tapate: Amram, Izhar, Hebron le Uzziel hi a, Kohath pen kum za le kum sawmthum le thum a hing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Merari tapate: Mahli le Mushi ahi hi. Tam teng pen amau’ khang tawh kizui-in Levi’ innkuonte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amram in a pa’ sanggamnu Jochebed zi-in la a, tua nu in ama tawh Aaron le Moses nei hi. Amram kum za le kum sawmthum le sagi a hing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Izhar tapate: Korah, Nepheg le Zichri ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Uzziel’ tapate: Mishael, Elzaphan le Sithri ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aaron in Amminadab’ tanu, Nahshon’ sanggam nu Elisheba zi-in a la hi. Tua nu in ama tawh Nadab, Abihu, Eleazar le Ithamar nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Korah’ tapate: Assir, Elkanah le Abiasaph hi a, tam teng pen Korah-te’ innkuonte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Aaron’ tapa Eleazar in Putiel’ tanute khat zi-in a la hi. Tua nu in ama tawh Phinehas nei hi. Tam teng pen a innkuon kuonin Levi-te’ be lutangte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Topa in, “Egypt panin Israel-te a honhonin peikhiet pi in,” a cina mite pen tam Aaron le Moses-te ma ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Egypt panin Israel-te a kipeipi nading thu Egypt kumpipa Pharaoh tawh a kiho mite pen tam Moses le Aaron ma ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Egypt gam sungah Topa in Moses a hopi ni-in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />ama in, “Keima in Topa ka hi hi. Nang tunga kang gen zosie Egypt kumpipa Pharaoh kungah gen in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ahi vangin Moses in Topa kungah, “En in, kei pen thugen siem lo mi ka hi hi. Bang dingin Pharaoh in kei thugen ei ngai ding ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Moses kungah, “En in, keima in Pharaoh tungah Pasien bangin nang kang bawl zo a, na sanggampa Aaron pen na kamsangpa hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nang kang thupieh zosie na gen ding a, na sanggampa Aaron in ama’ leitang panin Israel-te a peisah nadingin Pharoah kungah a gen ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahi vangin Pharaoh’ lungtang ka khausah ding a, Egypt gamah ka limte le na lamdangte ka tamsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pharaoh in na thu ang ngai lo ciengin keima in Egypt tungah ka khut ka nga ding a, thukhenna nasepna lienpite tawh ka mipi Israel-te a honhonin Egypt gam panin ka peipi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Egypt-te lang khatah ka khut zahin amate sung panin keima in Israel-te ka peikhietpi ciengin Egypt-te in keima Topa ka hina ei thei ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua bangin Moses le Aaron-te in a bawl uhi; Topa’ thupieh bangin amate in a sem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pharaoh tawh ama gel a kiho hunin Moses kum sawmgiet pha a, Aaron kum sawmgiet le kum thum pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa in Moses le Aaron kungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Pharaoh in na kung vuah, ‘Na lamdang khat hing bawl un,’ ang ci ciengin nangma in Aaron kungah, ‘Na ciengkhut la inlen Pharaoh mai-ah sepsuh in, tua ciengkhut gul ang suoh ding hi,’ ci in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuaci’n Pharaoh kungah Moses le Aaron pei-in Topa thupieh bangin a bawl uhi; Aaron in Pharaoh le a uliente mai-ah a ciengkhut a sepsuh a, gul khat a suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ciengin Pharaoh in mipilte le ai siemte hlan hi; Egypt mitphiel siemte in zong a siemna utawh tua bang lien ma-in a bawl thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A ciengkhut ciet uh a sepsuh vua, tuate gul vive a suoh hi; ahi vangin Aaron’ ciengkhut in amau-a’ a valtum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa gensa bangin Pharaoh’ lungsim khauh lai a, ama in a thugen uh a ngai nuom sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in Moses kungah, “Pharaoh’ lungtang khauh mama a, ama in mite peisah nuom lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Zingmawngin gunah Pharaoh a pei ciengin ama kungah pei in; ama tawh kimu dingin gun gei-ah ding inlen, gul a suoh ciengkhut pen ma na khut sungah tawi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama kungah, ‘Senel gamah keima ei bieh thei nadingun, “Ka mite peisah in, ci-in a gen dingin Hebrew-te’ Pasien, Topa in na kungah kei ei sawl hi,” ci-in gen in. Ahi vangin tu dongin ama’ thu na mang nai vaset sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ahi ciengin Topa in, “Keima Topa ka hina tami tawh na thei ding hi,” ci hi. En in, ka khut sunga ciengkhut tawh Nile gun sunga tui ka sat ding a, tua tui sisan a suoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Gun sunga om ngate si-in, a gun mama uithan ding a, Egypt-te in Nile guntui a dawn thei sih ding uhi,’ ci in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Topa in Moses kungah, “Aaron kungah, ‘Na ciengkhut la inlen tuate sisan a suo thei nadingin Egypt tuite uh tung, a gunte uh tung, a tuilamte uh tung, a tui tawdawhte uh tung le a buol zosie uh tungah na khut zah in; tuale Egypt gamsung zosie-ah sisan om ding a, sing beel le suong beel sung teng nangawnah sisan om ding hi,’ ci-in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Moses le Aaron in Topa’ thupieh bang ma-in a bawl uhi. Ama in Pharaoh le a uliente muna-ah tua ciengkhut vihto-in gun sunga om tua tui sat a, gun sunga tui zosie sisan a suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Gun sunga ngate a si sieng hi. Tua guntui khu a ui ziehin Egypt-te in tui a dawn thei sih uhi. Egypt gam mun zosie-ah sisan a dim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hinanle mitphiel siem Egypt mite in a siemna utawh tua bang lien ma-in bawl thei uhi; tuaci’n Topa gensa bangin Pharaoh’ lungtang a khauh ngai bangin khauh a, a thu uh ngai lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Pharaoh kihei-in a inn sungah lut a, a lungsim sung nangawnah tam thu ngaisutin a nei nawn sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Amate in guntui a dawn thei lo ziehun Egypt-te zosie in Nile gun kimah dawn ding tui a to uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Topa in Nile gun a sat zaw ni sagi pha ta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in Moses kung ah, “Pharaoh kungah pei-in ama kungah, ‘ Topa in tam bangci hi: “Amate in keima ei bieh thei nadingun ka mite peisah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amate na peisah nuom sih leh uphawh tawh na gam buppi gimna kang pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nile gun sungah uphawh a dim ding hi; na kumpi inn sung, na lupna inndan sung, na lupna tung, na uliente’ inn sung le na mipite’ inn sung, na lungthu tung ule na annel pawina kuong sung teng vuah ang lut ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nangma tung, na mite tung le na ulien zosie tungah uphawhte ang kato ding hi,” ci hi,’ ci-in gen in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa in Moses kungah, “Aaron kungah, ‘Gunte, tui zawite, le buoltuite tungah na ciengkhut tawh na khut zah inlen, Egypt leitang tungah uphawhte katosah in,’ ci-in gen in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaci’n Aaron in Egypt’ tuite tungah a khut a zah hi; tuale uphawhte kato a, Egypt leitang a tuommang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hinanle mitphiel siemte in a siemna utawh tua bang lien ma-in a bawl thei vua, Egypt leitang tungah uphawhte a katosah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ciengin Pharaoh in Moses le Aaron hlanin, “Kei le ka mite kung panin uphawhte a lah nadingin Topa kungah thu ngen un. Topa kungah biehna lui dingin mite ka peisah ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Moses in Pharaoh kungah, “Na kung pan le na innte panin uphawhte kihemin Nile gun sung behah a om den nadingin bang hun ciengin nang ading, na uliente ading le na mipite adingin thu hing ngetpieh ding ka hei, ei gen in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama in, ”Zing cieng,” a ci hi. Moses in, “ Topa kohaw’ Pasien tawh a kibang koima om lo hi, ci na thei nadingin na ci bang hi taheh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Uphawhte in nang le na innte, na uliente le na mite ang peisan ding hi; Nile gun behah amate kinuasie ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ciengin Pharaoh kung pan Moses le Aaron a pei uhi; tuale Moses in Pharaoh tunga a tunsah uphawhte tawh kisai-in Topa kungah a kiko hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa in Moses ngetna bangin a bawl hi: Inn sung, innhuong sung, le lote lahah uphawhte a si hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amate in a lom lomin tuate a khawm vua, gam sung teng a uithan sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pharaoh in a noptuom lam a mu ciengin a lungtang khausah a, Topa gensa bangin amate’ thu ngai lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in Moses kungah, “Aaron kungah, ‘Egypt gam buppi-ah gam tho a om nadingin na ciengkhut zah inlen leivui sat in,’ ci-in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuale amate in tua bang ma-in a bawl uhi; Aaron in a ciengkhut tawh a khut zahin leivui sat a, mihing tung le ganhing tungah a kibangin gam thote tu hi; Egypt gambuppi sunga leivui zosie gam tho a suoh sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mitphiel siemte in a phuolsel uh siemna tawh gam tho suosah ding a hanciem vangun a bawl thei sih uhi. Mihingte le ganhingte tungah gam tho a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mitphiel siemte in Pharaoh kungah, “Tami khu Pasien’ khutme ahi bo hi!” a ci uhi. Hinanle Pharaoh’ lungsim khauh a, Topa gensa bangin a thugen uh a ngai sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in Moses kungah, “Zingmawng tho bai inlen, tuikhuh zuonin Pharaoh ang pei ciengin a mai-ah na kilah inlen ama kungah, ‘ Topa in tam bangin gen hi: Amate in keima ei bieh thei nadingun ka mite peisah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua bang hi loin ka mite na peisah nuom sih leh nang, na uliente, na mite tung le na inn sung tengah ankuong tho honpite kang hla ding hi; Egypt-te’ innte le tuate’ tenna leitang zong ankuong tho honpite tawh a kidim ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahi vangin tua ni ciengin tami leitangah kei Topa ka hina na thei nadingun, ka mite tenna Goshen leitang ankuong tho honpite in a bop lo nadingin ka tuom koi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua bangin ka mite le na mite kikalah kilamdanna khat ka bawl ding hi. Zing ciengin tam ciemtena ang om ding hi,” ci hi,’ ci-in gen in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Topa in tua bang ma-in bawl a, ankuong tho honpite in Pharaoh’ inn sung le a uliente’ inn sung teng a bawm valuoi hi; ankuong thote ziehin Egypt gamsung zosie-ah leitang kisie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua ciengin Pharaoh in Moses le Aaron hlanin ama in, “Pei un, tam gam sungah na Pasien uh tungah biehna lui un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ahi vangin Moses in, ”Tua banga bawl ding pen dih lo hi; azieh pen ka Topa ka Pasien uh kunga ka lui uh biehna pen Egypt-te adingin a kidahhuoi ahi hi. Egypt-te muna-ah a kidah uh biehna lui uleng amate in suong tawh ei seplia lo ding uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ni thum sung peina gamlahah pei-in, ama’ ei thupieh bangin Topa ka Pasien uh kungah biehna ka va lui ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuaci’n Pharaoh in, ”Gamlapi-ah na pei sih ding po uleh gam lahah Topa na Pasien uh tungah biehna lui dingin kang peisah ding hi. Kei adingin thu ei ngetpieh in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tua ciengin Moses in, “Nangma kung panin ka pei zaw behin Topa kungah thu ka ngen ding a, zing ciengin Pharaoh kung pan, a uliente kung pan le a mite kung panin ankuong tho honpite a leng mang sieng ding hi; Topa kunga biehna a pie ding mite phal lona tawh Pharaoh hing zuoutat kia nawn poma sin,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuaci’n Pharaoh kung pan Moses pei-in Topa kungah thu a ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Topa in Moses’ nget bangin a pie a, Pharaoh kung, a uliente kung, le a mite kung panin ankuong tho honpite lengmangsahin khat zong a om nawn sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ahi vangin Pharaoh in a lungtang khausah lai veve a, mite peisah nuom lo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in Moses kungah, “Pharaoh kungah pei-in ama kungah, ‘Hebrew-te’ Pasien Topa in tam bangci hi: Amate in keima ei bieh thei nadingun ka mite peisah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile amate peisah nuom loin na tuhkon den leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa’ banhat in na lozau-a a om ganhingte ahi, sakolte, laate, kalaohte, bawnghonte, le tuuhonte tungah pul natna tawh ang vatmai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hizongle Israel-a’ zosie khat beh a si lo nadingin Israel-te’ ganhingte le Egypt-te’ ganhingte kikalah Topa in kilamdanna khat a bawl ding hi,” ci hi, va ci ta’n,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa in hun khat se a, “Zing ciengin Topa in gam sungah tami ang sem ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A zing ciengin Topa in tua bangin sem hi; Egypt-te’ ganhing zosie si sieng a, ahi vangin Israel-te’ ganhing khat zong si lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pharaoh in thukante sawlin Israel-te’ ganhing khat zong a si lo lam thei hi. Ahi vangin Pharaoh’ lungtang khauh lai a, ama in mite peisah lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in Moses le Aaron kungah, “Meikhuh sunga vut na khut dimin ham unlen, Pharaoh muna-ah Moses in vantung lamah tua vut theto heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua khu Egypt gam buppi-ah leivui nel suoh ding a, Egypt gam buppi-ah mihing le ganhingte tungah uilut hima a suoh ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuaci’n meikhuh panin ama gel in vut la-in Pharaoh’ mai-ah a ding vua, Moses in vantung lamah tua vut a theto leh tuate in mihingte le ganhingte tungah uilut hima naikul a piengsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Uilut hima ziehin Moses mai-ah mitphiel siemte a ding zo nawn sih uhi. Bang ding ahei cile mitphiel siemte le Egypt-te zosie in zong uilut a vei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahi vangin Topa in Pharaoh’ lungtang khausah a, Moses kungah Topa in a gensa ma bangin ama in a thu uh ngai lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in Moses kungah, “Zing ciengin thobai-inlen, Pharaoh mai-ah kipulahin ama kungah, ‘Hebrew-te’ Pasien, Topa in tam bangci hi: Amate in keima ei bieh thei nadingun ka mite peisah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile leitung buppi-ah keima tawh a kibang koima khat beh om lo hi, ci na thei nadingin keima in tami hunin nang, na uliente, le na mite tungah ka pul natna zosie kang tungsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Azieh pen tu-in ka khut zahin pul natna tawh nang le na mite kang vatmai thei a, leitung panin zong kang sumai thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hinanle nangma kang hinkhawina pen tam zieh ahi hi: Na tungah ka vanglietna kang lah nading le leitung buppi-ah ka min a kiphuongzah thei nading ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nang le nang na kiliensah lai vaset a, ka mite langbawlin a pei ding uh na phal sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Zing cieng tu bang hunin Egypt gam kisat huna kipan tuhun donga a kimu ngai nai lo, a nasie penpen gielpi ka kiesah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin mi sawl inlen lozau-a na ganhingte le na nei na lam zosie munbih khatah tuosah in; tuate tungah gielpi ang kieh ciengin kibuhna munah a kipeipi lo, lozau-a a om mihing ahi a, ganhing ahi zongin a si ding hi,’ ci-in gen in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Pharaoh’ uliente lahah Topa’ kammal a zatah pawlkhat in munbih khatah a salte ule a ganhingte a nawtaisah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Topa’ kammal a thusim lo mite in lozau-ah a salte ule a ganhingte a nuasie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Topa in Moses kungah, “Egypt gam sung zosie-a om mihing, ganhing le Egypt gamsung lote lahah a po singkung zosiete tungah gielpi a kieh thei nadingin vantung lamah na khut zah in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua ciengin vantung lamah Moses in a ciengkhut zah a, Topa in van tosahin giel kiesah a, leitungah meikuong a kumsuh hi. Topa in Egypt gamah gielpi kiesah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuami laikimah gielpi le meikuong khawl loin phe lahlah a, gam khat ahi zaw a kipanin Egypt gamsung buppi-ah tam banga gielpi siehuoi a kie ngai nai sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tumi gielpi in Egypt gambup sung lozau lahah a om na vannuoi, mihing le ganhing a ni-in a satpaai hi; gielpi in lozau-a kung zosie zong satpai a, lozau-a singkung zosie zong vattan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Israel-te tenna Goshen gam behah gielpi kie lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua ciengin Pharaoh in mi sawlin Moses le Aaron a hlansah a, ama gel kungah, “Tun-in ahile kei ka khiel zo ta hi; keima le ka mipite ka khiel vua, Topa a dih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Topa kungah thum un! Pasien’ vanto le giel kicing zo ta! Kang peisah ta ding vua, na thaam uh a ngai nawn sih hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Moses in ama kungah, “Tam khuopi panin ka pusuo behin Topa lamah ka khut ka zah ding hi. Leitung in Topa -a’ ahi hi, ci-in na thei nadingin vanto khawlin gielpi veng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ahi vangin nang le na uliente in Topa Pasien na giin nai vaset lo lam uh ka thei hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />(Tu-in anthul kungte le mangbuham kisie hi. Bang ding ahei cile mangbuhamte a vui laitah ahi a, anthul kungte a paa laitah ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ahi vangin mangbu le mangbumante kisie lo hi. Azieh pen tuate khangham nai lo hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuaci’n Pharaoh kung panin khuopi pulamah Moses peikhie a, Topa lamah a khut a zah ciengin vanto le gielpi khawl pai a, leitungah guo zu nawn lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ahi vangin Pharaoh in guopi, gielpi le vanto a theu zo lam a mu ciengin ama khatvei khiel lai a, ama le a uliente in a lungtang uh a khausah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tuaci’n Topa in Moses tungtawnin a gensa bangin Pharaoh’ lungtang khausah a, Israel-te peisah lo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in Moses kungah, “Pharaoh kungah va pei in; azieh pen amate lahah tami ka limte ka lah thei nading le
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Egypt-te ka motbawlna le amate lahah bang limte bawl zo ka hei, ci thu na tate le na tute’ zaha na gen thei nading le, keima Topa ka hi lam na thei nadingin ama’ lungtang le a uliente’ lungtang ka khausah hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaci’n Pharaoh kungah Moses le Aaron pei-in, “Hebrew-te’ Pasien, Topa in tam bangci hi: ‘Ka mai-a nang kiniemkhieh ding bang tanvei niel sawm na hei? Amate in keima ei bieh thei nadingun ka mite peisah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Azieh pen ka mite pei ding na niel leh zing ciengin na gam sungah kauphe kang tungsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Koima in leitang a mu thei lo nadingin kauphete in lei maitang zosie tuommang ding uhi. Kauphe in giel khiehmawhte netum a, lozau-a na suon uh singkung zosie valtum sieng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na innsung, na ulien zosie’ innsung le Egypt-te zosie’ inn sungah leitunga a pien vua kipan tuni dongin na pu na pate in a mukhah ngai nai lo uh kauphete a dimin ang om ding hi,’ ci hi,” ci-in a gen hi. Tua ciengin ama kihei-in Pharaoh kung pan a pusuoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pharaoh’ uliente in ama kungah, “Eite tungah tam mipa bang tanvei thangkam banga hing om ding ahei? Amate in a Pasien uh ahi Topa a bieh thei nadingun mite peisah in. Egypt a kisiet lam a thei nai lo na hi amah?” ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuaci’n Pharaoh kungah Moses le Aaron kipeipi kia a, ama in a kung vuah, “Pei unlen na Topa na Pasien uh va bie ta un! Ahi vangin koi teng pei ding na hi uh ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Moses in, “Ka khangnote le ka khanghamte tawh ka pei ding uhi; ka tapate, ka tanute, ka ganhingte le ka bawnghonte utawh ka pei ding uhi, bangzieh ahei cile Topa’ pawi ka kham ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pharaoh in amate kungah, “Note tawh na naupangte kang peisah tah leh no tawh Pasien ang om tahtah hi ta ven! Keima in kang sieng genin, na lungsim sung vuah ngimna hoi lo na nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua bang hi thei buong lo e! No pasal teng pei unlen, Topa va bie ta un, azieh pen noma’ ang nget ahi hi,” a ci hi. Tuale Pharaoh kung panin amate kinotmang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in Moses kungah, “Egypt leitangah kauphete tu-in, gielpi’ khiehmawh kung zosie a neh thei nadingin Egypt leitang tungah na khut zah in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuaci’n Moses in Egypt leitang tungah a ciengkhut zah a, Topa in khumi ni sun tungtawn le khumi ni zan tungtawnin leitang tungah nisuona hui a langsah hi; zingmawng ciengin nisuona hui in kauphete a puoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nidang hunin a om ngai nai lo, bangma cih hunin zong a om ngai nawn lo ding, Egypt leitang tung zosie-ah kauphe honpi tung a, Egypt gam buppi-ah a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Leitang a miel zo ding za-in kauphete in lei maitang vannuoi a tuomcip hi; amate in gam sunga om kung zosie le gielpi’ khiehmawh singkung ga zosie a netum uhi; Egypt leitang tung zosie-ah gamlah singkungte hile kungnote hile a na dawng khat beh om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pharaoh in Moses le Aaron naw hlat a, “ Topa na Pasien uh’ tung le nogel tungah ka khiel zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tu tung tami ka mawna ei maisah in. Ama in ka kung panin tami sina a lah nadingin na Topa Pasien kungah thum in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pharaoh kung panin ama pei-in Topa kungah thu ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Topa in tuami nisuona huipi pen a hat mama nitumna huipi suohsah a, kauphete tawmangin San Tuipi denna-in nei hi; Egypt gam sungah kauphe khat zong om nawn lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahi vangin Topa in Pharaoh’ lungtang khausah a, Israel-te peisah nuom lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in Moses kungah, “Egypt leitang tungah khuomiel, a kitham thei za-a khuomiel a om thei nadingin vantung lamah na khut zah in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuaci’n Moses in vantung lamah a khut zah a, Egypt gam leitang zosie-ah nithum sung mutzin a tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ni thum sung amate khatlekhat a kimu thei sih vua, a opna panun koima a pupiel thei sih hi; ahi vangin Israel-te’ tenna munah khuo a vah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua ciengin Pharaoh in Moses hlanin, “Pei unlen Topa va bie ta un. Na tuuhonte ule na bawnghonte uh beh nuasie un. Na tate uh nangawn zong na zawpi thei ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahi vangin Moses in, “ Topa ka Pasien uh’ tungah biehpiehnate le meihal biehnate nei piehsah lo phamaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ka ganhingte uzong koma tawh a zawton lo phamaw a, ganhing kecin khat zong kinuasie thei lo ding hi, bangzieh ahei cile Topa ka Pasien uh ka bieh nadingun tuate lah panin pawlkhat ka deitel ding uh phamaw hi. A mun ka tun masangun Topa bieh nadingin bang pen zang ding ci ka thei nai sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hizongle Topa in Pharaoh’ lungtang khausah a, a pei ding uh phal lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua ciengin Pharaoh in ama kungah, “Ka kung panin peimang ta’n! Ka mai nei mukia lo nadingin kidawm in. Azieh pen ka mai nei mu ni ni-in na si ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Moses in, “Na gen bangin hi taheh! Na mai kang mu ngai nawn sih ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Moses kungah, “Pharaoh le Egypt tungah gimna khat ka tungsah lai ding hi; tua zaw ciengin tam mun panin ama in note ang peisah ding hi. Ama in note ang peisah ciengin ang notmang sieng ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pasal poma in a vengte’ kung pan, numei poma in zong a vengte’ kung panin ngun le kham kizepnate a nget nadingun mite kungah gen in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Egypt-te muna-ah Topa in mite maipha pie hi. Tua tham loin Moses mama zong Egypt leitang tung, Pharaoh’ uliente muna le mipite muna-ah mi thupi mama khat a suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Moses in, “ Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Zankim pawlin Egypt gam muncin tengah ka pei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Egypt gama tacil zosie, a kumpi topha tunga to Pharaoh’ tacil pen a kipan, an gawina nua-a om nasem numei’ tacil zosie, le ganhing lah panin tacil zosie si ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ciengin Egypt gam buppi-ah bangma huna tua bang a om ngai lo, mai lamah zong a omkia ngai nawn lo ding kaana le mauna lienpi a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahi vangin Topa in Egypt le Israel a tuom khen lenlon hi, ci na thei nadingun Israel-te, mihing hile ganhing hile, ui khat in zong kawh lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ciengin keima kungah na uliente uh hing peisuhin, ka mai-ah ang lukun ding vua, ‘Nang le nangma ang zui mi zosie peidawh ta un,’ ang ci ding uhi. Tua ciengin kei ka pei ding hi,” a ci hi. Pharaoh’ kung panin a lungsosa-in peikhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa in Moses kungah, “Egypt-ah nalamdang ka tam bawl thei nadingin Pharaoh in na thu ang ngai sih ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pharaoh mai-ah Moses le Aaron in na lamdang tam teng a bawl uhi; ahi vangin Topa in Pharaoh’ lungtang khausah a, a leitang panin Israel-te peisah lo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Egypt gam sungah Topa in Moses le Aaron kungah tam bangin gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tami hla pen note dingin hla kipatna hi ding hi; note dingin kum khat sunga a hla masa pen hi ding hi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel mihon vannuoi kungah gen unlen, khumi hla ni sawm ni-in amate in a innkuon ciet vua dingin tuuno khat ta a la ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuuno luong khat ne dinga innkuonmi a tawm seng leh, a kinaipi pen a vengte tawh tua luong khat kitang ding uhi; a ne ding mi phaza tawh kituohin tuuno sa kihawm ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na tuuno uh paubaang lo, kum khat a cingsa apa khat hi ding hi; tuami adingin tuu ahi sihle keel khat popo na la thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua tuuno, khumi hla ni sawm le ni li cieng dong na khum ding uhi; tua ciengin Israel mihon zosie in nitah lamin tuami gan go ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate in a si kimkhat la-in a sunga a nehna uh inn kotkhah khuom nite le a bangtung zawl nu ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amate in khumi zan ma-in tuuno sa ne ding uhi; amate in mei-ah tua sa hangin tol saw lo anlum le tangkhate tawh me ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua sa a sielin ahi sihle tui tawh huonin na ne sih ding vua, ahi vangin mei tungah a lu a kengte le a sungkuote na hang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Zingmawng dongin tuate khawnla khat beh na omsah sih ding uhi; zingmawng donga a kikhawngla popo na haltum ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na neh dan ding uh tam bang ahi hi: Na kawng uh kigahin na keng vuah kedap bunin, na khut vuah na ciengkhut uh na tawi ding uhi; tuale mallang tahin na ne ding uhi. Tuami khu Topa’ Peisan Pawi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Azieh pen khum zanin Egypt leitang ka nawhsuoh ding a, Egypt leitang tunga om tacil zosie, mihingte le ganhingte a nipi-in ka vatmai ding hi; Egypt pasien-te zosie tungah thu ka khen ding hi: Keima Topa ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na tenna uh inn tunga sisan khu no adingin lim khat hi ding hi: Keima in sisan ka mu ciengin kang kalsan ding vua, Egypt leitang ka vatmai ciengin zong ang susie ding gimna na tung vuah ang tung sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tami ni pen note dingin phawna ni hi ding hi. Note in Topa tungah tuami ni pen pawi bawlna ni-in na zang ding uhi; na khang tungtawnun biehna ngaina kip khatin na nei zing ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ni sagi sung tol saw lo anlum na ne ding uhi; a ni masa ni-in na inn panun tol na hemdawh ding uhi, azieh pen mi khatpo in a ni masa panin a ni sagi ni dongin tol kisaw anlum a neh leh Israel sung panin kihemkhie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A ni masa ni-in a siengtho kikhopna khat na nei ding uhi, tuale a ni sagi ni-in zong a siengtho kikhopna khat ma na nei ding uhi; mi zosie’ neh ding an na huon ding uh ci simlo, tua hun sung tengin bangma na kisem lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tolsaw lo anlum pawi na bawl ding uhi, bang ding ahei cile tua ni ma-in keima in Egypt leitang panin na mihonte uh ka peipi hi: Na khang tawntungun tami ni pen biehna ngaina kip khatin na nei zing ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A hla masa pen, a ni sawm le ni li ni panin ni sawmni le ni khat nitah dongin tol kisaw lo anlum na ne ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na inn sung vuah ni sagi sung tol kici kimukha lo ding hi; koipo, pemta ahi a, gammi ahi zongin tol kisaw a neh leh Israel mihonpi lah panin kihemkhie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tol kisaw poma na ne sih ding uhi; na tenna zosie vuah tol kisaw lo anlum na ne ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ciengin Moses in Israel upate zosie hlanin amate kungah, “Pei unlen, na innkuon vua dingin tuunote teelin peisan tuuno go un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hyssop’ na lomkhat la-in kuong sunga om sisan sungah die unlen, tua kuong sunga sisan tawh bangtung zawl le kotbieng khuom nite nu un. Zingmawng masangin koima in na inn kot pulam uh na kal sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Egypt-te vatmai dingin Topa in ang nawh ding a, bangtung zawl le kotbieng khuom nite tunga sisan a mu ciengin Topa in tuami kotpi a peisan ding a, na inn sung vuah note ang vatmai ding a susie pa a lutsah sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Note le na tapate in biehna ngaina kip khatin tami dan na zang zing ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Note ang ciemsa bangin Topa in ang pieh ding leitangah na tun ciengun tami sil bawldan na zui ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Na tate un na kung vuah, ‘Tami sil kibawl bang a cinopna ahiei? ci-a ang dot ciengun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />‘Tami Topa’ peisan biehpiehna ahi hi. Azieh pen ama in Egypt-te vatmai-in, ahi vangin ei innkuon teng ei hinkhawi lai a, Egypt gam sungah Israel’ innkuonte a peisan hi,’ na ci ding uhi,” a ci hi. Tuale mite lukunin Pasien a bie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Topa in Moses le Aaron a thupieh bangin Israel-te pei-in a gamta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Zankim ciengin Topa in Egypt gam sunga om tacil zosie, a kumpi topha tunga a to Pharaoh’ tacil-a kipan thongmiel sunga a om saltangte’ tacilte le ganhingte’ tacil zosie a vatmai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Khumi zanin Pharaoh le a uliente le Egypt mi zosie a tho uhi; tuale Egypt gam sungah kaana lienpi a om hi. Azieh pen misi om lona inn khat zong om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in Moses le Aaron a zan thuta a, ama gel kungah, “Ding un, ka mite lah panin noma ni le Israel-te peikhie ta un! Pei unlen na gen bangun Topa bie un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Na gen bangun na tuuhonte ule na bawnghonte uh zawpi unlen peimang ta un. Kei zong thupha ei pie un!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Manlang taha tua gam a nuasie nadingun Egypt-te in mite a hantawh uhi, azieh pen amate in, “I unpi vua a si sieng ding i hi ta uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tuaci’n mite in tol a kisaw masangin a annel lom uh la-in, puon tawh annel pawina a kuongte uh tunin a liengko tung vuah a puo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Moses in a kung vua a gen bangin Israel-te a gamta uhi; amate in Egypt-te kung pan ngun le kham kizepnate, le puonte a ngen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />A ngette uh a pieh nadingun Topa in Egypt-te’ muna-ah mite maipha pie hi. Israel-te in tua bangin Egypt mite’ na a tomgampieh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Numei le naupangte kisim lo, Rameses panin Succoth-ah Israel-te pasal tul zaguh keng tawh a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Minam kisawhal honpite, tuuhon le bawnghon, ganhing tampite zong amate tawh a peiton uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Amate in Egypt pana a ken uh annel lom panin tol kisaw lo moh a em uhi; tuate pen tol kisaw lo ahi hi, azieh pen Egypt panin amate kinotmang a, khuongai man lo lienga ang pei ziehun a an neh ding uzong a guong man sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Egypt-ah Israel-te a ten hun sung uh kum zali le kum sawmthum ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Kum zali le kum sawmthum a cin tuami ni ma-in, Egypt leitang panin a unpi-un Topa’ mihonte a peikhie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Egypt leitang panin a peipi thei nadingun khum zan pen Topa adingin zanha ni ahi hi. Israel-te zosie in a khang khangin khum zan pen Topa adingin zanha zanin a tang zing ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Topa in Moses le Aaron kungah tam bangin gen hi: Tam pen Peisan pawi bawl dan ding ngaina kip ahi hi: Gamdang mi koima in tua khu a ne sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Ahi vangin a kileisa sila poma in tep a kitan zaw ciengin ne thei ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />suoh le salte ahi sihle a kiciel nasemte in ne thei lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tua pen inn khat sungah kine ding hi; inn pulamah a sa na pusuopi sih ding vua, a gu khat zong na tawngsah sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Israel mihon buppi in tami pawi a bawl ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Na tentonpi uh pemta khatpo in Topa kungah peisan pawi a bawl nop leh a mipi pasal zosie a tep uh kitan ding hi; tua ciengin ama in tuami a bawl nadingin a kungah neh ding hi; tuolsung mi khat bangin ama kingaisun ding hi. Hizongle tep tan lote in ne thei lo ding ahi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />tuolsung mite le na lah vua a teng khuol mite adingin zui ding thukham khat beh om ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Topa in Moses le Aaron a thupieh bangin Israel-te zosie in a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Khumi ni ma-in Topa in Egypt gam panin Israel-te a honhonin a peipi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Moses kungah tam bangin gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tacil zosie keima adingin siensuo un; Israel-te lahah mihing hitale ganhing hitale, naubu hong masa pen popo kei-a’ ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Moses in mite kungah, “Na sal tanna Egypt gam panin na pei ni uh ahi tami ni phawh un, azieh pen Topa in a thahat khut tawh khum mun panin note ang peipi hi; tol kisaw anlum kine lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Abib hla sung, tuni-a peikhie na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa in pieh dinga na pu na pate kunga a na ciemsa bawngnawi le khuoizu luonna leitang, Canaan-te, Hit-te, Amor-te, Hiv-te le Jebus-te’ tenna leitangah ang peipi ciengin tami hla sungin tami na bawl ding uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ni sagi sung tol kisaw lo anlum na ne ding vua, a ni sagi ni-in Topa adingin pawi khat om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ni sagi sung tol kisaw lo anlum kine ding hi. Na neisate sung vuah tol kisaw anlum kimu lo ding a, na tenna uh mun zosie-a na lah vuah zong tol kici kimukha lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khum ni-in na tapate uh kungah, ‘Egypt panin ka peikhiet lai-in Topa in kei adinga ei bawlpieh zieh ahi hi,’ ci-in na gen ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na kam sung vuah Topa’ thuhilna a op thei nadingin note dingin tami khu na khut tung vuah lim khat hi ding a, na talpang tung vuah phawna khat hi ding hi; azieh pen Topa in a thahat khut tawh Egypt leitang panin note ang peipi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A kise hunin kum khat pan kum khat, tami biehna ngaina kip na zui ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Ama in note tung le na pu na pate uh tunga a ciemsa bangin Topa in Canaan leitangah ang peipi hun cieng le na tung vuah tuami gam ang pieh ciengin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa adingin naubu hong masa zosie na tuomkoi ding uhi. Na ganhon uh tacil apa zosie Topa -a’ hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahi vangin laa tacil poma tuuno khat tawh na tanh ding uhi; na tat sih uleh a ngawng na hiatawng ding uhi. Na tapate uh lah panin tacil poma na tanh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mai lam hunah na tapa in tami bang a cinopna ahiei?’ ci-a ang dawh ciengin ama kungah, ‘Saltanna Egypt panin a thahat khut tawh Topa in ei na peipi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pharaoh in lungkhauh tahin peisah ding ei na niel ciengin Topa in Egypt gam sunga tacil zosie, mihing tacil le ganhing tacil zosie a thatgam hi. Tua ahi ziehin naubu hong masa apa zosie Topa tungah biehpiehna-in ka pie hi, ahi vangin ka tapate sung pana a pieng tacil zosie ka tankia hi,’ na ci ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua khu na khut tungah lim bang hi ding a, na talpang tungah ciemtena lim bang hi ding hi. Azieh pen Topa in a banhat tawh Egypt gam panin eite ei peipi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pharaoh in mite a peisah ciengin Philistia gam lam naizaw tamaleh, Pasien in tua lamah amate peipi lo hi; azieh pen Pasien in, ‘Mite in gal le sa tuoh uleh a lungsim uh kikhelin Egypt gamah kinuale thei kha ding uhi,” ci-in ngaisun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuaci’n Pasien in San Tuipi lam manaw-in senel gam lamah mite a kuol peipi hi. Israel-te gal do dinga a kithawisa-in Egypt gam panin a peito uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Joseph in, “Pasien in ang phawh kha valon ding vua, tua zaw ciengin tami mun panin ka gu ka tangte na puo ding uhi,” ci-in Israel-te kungah lipkhaphuoi kiciemna tawh a vaihlah ziehin Moses in Joseph’ gu le tangte a puo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Succoth pan amate a ding vua, senel gam mong, Etham-ah giephuol a sat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A sun a zanin khuol a zin thei nadingun sunin lam lah ding meii khuom khat tawh, zanin khuovah pie ding mei khuom khat tawh, a mai vuah Topa a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Suna meii khuompi, le zana mei khuompi in mite mai ama’ opna mun lawi lo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in Moses kungah tam bangin gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Israel-te kinua hei-in Migdol le tuipi kikal, Pi-hahiroth mai, Baal-zephon gei-ah giephuol a sat ding gen in; tuipi gei, tuami gal khatah giephuol na sat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pharaoh in Israel-te tawh kisai-in, ‘Tami gam sungah amate vahvai-in senel gam in vuanelh zo ta hi,’ ci ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pharaoh’ lungtang ka khausah ding a, amate a nuadel ding hi. Pharaoh le a galkap zosie tungtawnin minthanna ka nga ding hi; tuale Egypt-te in Topa ka hi lam ei thei ding uhi,” a ci hi. Tua bang ma-in amate gamta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mite taimang sieng zo ta hi, ci-in Egypt kumpipa kungah a kigen ciengin Pharaoh le a uliente’ lungsim kikhelin amate in, “I na ei seppieh Israel-te i peisah pen bangci gamtat mawh ta i hi uh ahei?” a kici uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama in a leeng kithawisahin a galkapte a la hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />a deiteel leng zaguh le Egypt leeng zosie a uhte tawh ama a kuonton hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa in Egypt kumpi Pharaoh’ lungtang khauhsahin hangsan taha a pei Israel-te a nuadel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Egypt-te ahi Pharaoh’ sakolte, leengte, a leeng hawl zosie le a galkapte in amate a nuadel uhi; amate in tuipi gei-ah giephuol satin a opna uh ahi Pi-hahiroth khuo gei, Baal-zephon khuo mai-ah a pha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pharaoh in amate a neh ciengin Israel-te a kinua hei vua, amate lamah Egypt mite a kuon uhi. A zau seng ziehun Topa tungah Israel-te a kiko uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amate in Moses kungah, “Egypt gama han a op lo ziehin senel gama si dinga nei zawpi amah? Egypt gam pana nei peipina tawh ka tung vua bang teng bawl mawh na hei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />‘Ei ci opsah lel inlen Egypt-te’ na ei semsah in,’ ci-in Egypt gama na kunga kang gen pen uh tami thu ma hi lo amah? Azieh pen senel gama ka si sangun Egypt-te’ na ka sep uh kote dingin hoizaw ding hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahi vangin Moses in mite kungah, “Zau sih unlen ding kip un. Tuale en un, tuni-in Topa in note dinga ang sep ding a hutkhietna mu un; azieh pen tuni-a na mu uh Egypt-te na mukia ngai nawn sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Topa in note dingin gal ang simpieh ding a, tuaci’n na op hit hiet ding beh uh ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in Moses kungah, “Bang dingin kei tunga hing kiko na hi uh ahei? Israel-te mainawtin a pei ding uh gen in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahi vangin Israel-te in tuipi laikimah tuolgaw a tot thei nadingun na ciengkhut lamto inlen, tuipi tungah na khut zahin khenkhe in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ciengin Egypt-te’ lungtang ka khausah ding a, amate in ang del ding uhi; tuaci’n keima in Pharaoh le a galkap zosie, a sakol leengte, a leeng hawlte tungtawnin minthanna ka nga ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pharaoh le a sakol leengte le a leeng hawlte tungtawnin minthanna ka nga ciengin Egypt-te in Topa ka hi lam ei thei ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ciengin Israel galkapte mai-a a pei Pasien’ vantungmi kikhinin amau’ nua-ah a pei hi; a mai panun meii khuom kikhin a, a nua vuah a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Egypt galkapte le Israel galkapte kikal ah tua meii a pei hi; tuale tua munah meii le khuomiel omton a, tuami in zan khuomiel a tangsah hi; zan tawntungin khatlekhat kinai kha loin a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ciengin Moses in tuipi tungah a khut a zah hi. Topa in zan tawntungin nisuona lam huipi hat tawh tuipi lemutsahin gamgaw a suohsah hi; tuale tua tuipi phal ni-in kikhen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amau’ ziet le vei-ah tuite kawm bangin omin tuipi tunga leigaw lahah Israel-te lam a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Egypt-te ahi Pharaoh’ sakolte zosie , a leengte le a leenghawlte in a nuadel vua, tuipi laikim amau’ nua-ah a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Zingmawng khuo va ciengin Topa in mei le meii khuom sung panin Egypt galkapte ensuh a, Egypt galkapte patausah gawp hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ama in a amau’ leengkangte a awsah ziehin hamsapi-in a hawl uhi. Egypt-te in, ”Israel-te mai panin taimang ta vai, azieh pen Topa in amate dingin Egypt-te a do hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in Moses kungah, “Egypt-te tung, a leengte uh tung, le a leeng hawlte uh tungah tami tui ang luonkia nadingin tuipi tungah na khut zah in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuaci’n tuipi tungah Moses in a khut zah a, zingmawng khuo a va ciengin tua tuipi a luon ngai bangin a luongkia hi. Tua tuipi panin Egypt-te a tai ciengun Topa in Egypt-te tuipi lam sena-in nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tui peikia-in leengte, leeng hawlte le tuipi sunga amate a del Pharaoh’ galkapte a unpi-in tui in hlummang hi; amate khat zong suohta lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ahi vangin tuipi laikim leigaw tungah Israel-te a pei vua, a ziet a vei vuah kawm bangin tuite a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Khum ni-in Topa in Egypt-te khut sung pan Israel-te tam bangin na hunkhie hi; tuale Israel-te in gunpieu-a si Egypt-te a mu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Israel-te in Egypt-te tungah Topa’ bawl nasepna lienpi a mu uhi. Tuaci’n mite in Topa a giing vua, Topa le a nasempa Moses a um uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin Moses le Israel-te in Topa kungah tami la a sa uhi: “ Topa tungah zeila sa vang, azieh pen vangnei tahin ama guol zo hi; sakolte le a tunga tuongte tuili lai-ah sepmang zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa khu ka zaitha le ka thahatna ahi a, ama ka hutdamna a suoh zo hi. Ama ka Pasien ahi a, ama ka phat ding hi. Keima in ka pa’ Pasien phatin ama ka liensah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa khu galhang pa hi a; ama’ min khu Topa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Ama in tuipi sungah Pharaoh’ leengte le a galkapte sepsuh a, San Tuipi sungah ama’ deiteel uliente a tummang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuihuol in amate khucip a, suongtum bangin a thuhna munah amate a tumsuh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa aw, na zietlam khut khu thahat sil bawl theina hi a- Topa aw, na zietlam khut in dogalte a vatmai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A thupi na vanglietna tawh ang langbawlte na bungbulet hi; na lungthahna na lengsah a, tua in hampa bangin amate katumsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na husan in tuipi li bang cingsahin, tuihuolpi zong cienphung bangin dingsah hi; tuili lai-a tui thuhte zong a khalh gawpsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Dogalte in, ‘Ka del ding a, ka nuaphah ding hi, gal vanlahte ka hawm ding a, tuate ka deizaza ka kitan ding hi. Ka namtem ka dawh ding a, amate ka khut tawh ka susie ding hi,’ a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na hui tawh na sem ciengin tuipi in amate a tuomcip hi. Tuipi gimnei sungah amate ngentang bangin a tumsuh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“ Topa aw, pasien-te lahah nangma tawh kibang koi om ahei? Sienthona-ah a lien, thupina-ah a lipkhap huoi, na lamdangte a bawl, nangma tawh kibang koi om ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na zietlam khut na zah a, lei in amate a valtum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“A tul ngai lo na itna tawh nangma in na tatsate na pui a; a siengtho na tenna munah na hatna tawh amate na pui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mite in za-in a kiling vua; Philistia gama tengte, lungkhamna in a tukon hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ciengin Edom uhpite lungkie-in, Moab makaite zau-in a ling vua; Canaan gam sunga tengte zosie lungkhamin a tuisuoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amate tungah zauna le citutna a tung hi. Topa aw, na mite in a kalsan masang, na tatsa mite in a kalsan masangin, na ban hat ziehin amate suongtum bangin pia loin om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Topa aw, na ten nadinga na bawlsa mun, Topa aw, na khut tawh na phusa biehbuh ah, amate na pui a, nangma’ luo muol tungah amate na suon hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Topa khu kumtawnin a maang zing ding hi, ci-in la a sa uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pharaoh’ sakolte, a leengte le a leenghawlte tawh tuipi sungah a pei lai-un Topa in a tung vuah tuipi tuite luongsahkia hi; ahi vangin tuipi laikim leihul tungah Israel-te a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ciengin Aaron’ sanggamnu kamsang Miriam in a khutah tawm a tawi hi; numei zosie lamin a tawmte utawh a zui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amate tungah Miriam in la sa hi: “ Topa kungah la sa un, azieh pen thupi tahin ama a guol zo hi. Ama in tuili lai-ah sakol le a hawlte a sepmang hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua ciengin Moses in San Tuipi pan Israel-te peipi a, Shur senel gam zuonin a pei uhi. Senel gamah nithum sung lam a pei vua, tui a mu sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Marah a tun ciengun tui kha ahi ziehin Marah tui a dawn thei sih uhi. Tua ahi ziehin khum mun pen Marah ci-in a min kiphuo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Moses tungah mite a phun vua, “Bang dawn ding i hi uh ahei?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Topa kungah ama kiko a, Topa in ama singthem khat lah hi; ama in tui sungah tua singthem a sep pai leh tuami tui a hlum pai hi. Topa in khum munah amate dingin thukham khat le ngaina kip khat bawlin khumi munah amate a zelah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ama in, “ Topa na Pasien uh’ aw limtah ngai-in ama muna-ah a manin na semin a thupiehte na thudon vua, a thukhamte na zui uleh note tungah Egypt gama ka tunsah natnate khat zong kang tungsah sih ding hi; bangzieh ahei cile kei khu note ang damsah Topa ka hi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua ciengin ciatui sawm le ni phulna le lutu kung sawm sagi a pona Elim ah a tung uhi; tuale amate in khum mun tui gei-ah giephuol a sat uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Elim panin Israel mihon vannuoi vai a ding uhi; tuale Egypt gam pan a dinkhiet zaw uh a hla nina ni sawm le ni nga ni-in Elim le Sinai kikala om Sin senel gamah Israel-te a tung uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Senel gamah Israel mihon vannuoi in Moses le Aaron a phunsan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel-te in ama gel kungah, “Sabel phungah to-in khamtahin an ka neh lai-un Topa’ khutlumin Egypt leitangah na kisi tazaw uleng izaw; bang ding ahei cile a kikhawm tami mihon buppi kielsisah dinga tami senel gama nei peipi gel ahi hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in Moses kungah, “Note dingin vantung panin anlum guo bangin ka zusah ding a, mite pei-in khumi ni-a a khamkhop ding uh anlum nisielin a luoh ding uhi. Tua bang danin amate in ka thuhil a zui uleh a zui lo uh ka zelah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua anlum luoh dinga a kisah ciengun a ni guh ni-in nidanga a luo za uh a zani a luoh ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaci’n Moses le Aaron in Israel-te zosie kungah, “Nitah ciengin Topa pen Egypt gam pana note ang peipi pa ahi lam na thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa tunga na phunna uh ama in za zo ahi ziehin zingmawng ciengin Topa’ vanglietna na mu ding uhi. Azieh pen ka tung vua na phunphun uh, ko bang hi mawh ka hi uh ahei?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Moses in, “A tunga na phunphun uh Topa in za zo ahi ziehin Topa in na tung vuah nitah cienga na neh dinguh sa, le zingmawng cienga khamtaha na neh ding uh an ang pieh ciengin kote bang ka hi uh ahei? Na phunphun uh pen kote tunga phun na hi sih vua, Topa tunga phun na hi uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ciengin Moses in Aaron kungah, “Israel mihon vannuoi tungah, ‘Ama in na phunna uh za zo a hi ziehin a nai-ah hing neh un,’ ci-in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aaron in Israel mihonte a hopi laitahin gamlah a en vua, amate in mei lahah Topa’ vanglietna a kilang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa in Moses kungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Israel-te’ phunna ka za zo hi. Amate kungah, ‘Khuomut ciengin sa na ne ding vua, zingmawng ciengin khamtahin an na ne ding uhi; tua ciengin keima Topa na Pasien uh ka hi lam nei thei ding uhi,’ ci-in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nitah ciengin vamimte lengin giephuol khucip hi; zingmawngin giephuol kimah daicim a daldalin kie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Daicim a kap ciengin senel gam lei maitang tungah a pa dihdeh a phal phala a om, vuakhal tawh a kibang na hoi khat a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Israel-te in a mu ciengun khatlekhat in, “Tam bang ahiei?” a kici uhi. Azieh pen amate in tua khu bang ahei ci a thei sih uhi. Moses in amate kungah, “Tami pen Pasien in na neh ding vua ang pieh an ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa’ thupieh tam bang ahi hi: ‘Na milipun tam an na dei zaza uh khawm ciet un. Na puonbuh sung vua mi phaza tawh kizui-in mi khat adingin omer khat ciet na khawm ding uhi,’ ci hi,” ci-in a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua bang ma-in Israel-te a gamta vua, kimkhat in a tamzaw, kimkhat in a tawmzaw a khawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ahi vangin omer tawh a te ciengun a tampi khawmte-a’ dimval loin themno khat a khawmte-a’ zong cingla tuon lo hi; amate in a milipin a kisap za ciet a khawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Moses in amate kungah, “Zingmawng dongin koima in tuate hen sih heh,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahi vangin amate in Moses’ thugen a mang sih uhi; mi pawlkhat in zingmawng dongin tuate halkhat a hen vua, tuale than tu-in a ui sieng hi. Amate tungah Moses a lungthah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amate in zingmawng sielin a neh khop ding ciet uh a khawm uhi; ahi vangin ni a ham ciengin tuate zungmang sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amate in a ni guh ni-in an a zani, omer ni ciet a khawm uhi. Moses kungah mihon makai zosie pei-in a gen ciengun
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Moses in amate kungah, “Tam khu Topa’ ei thupieh ahi hi: ‘Zingcieng pen a lipkhap huoi tawlngah ni, Topa dinga Sabbath siengtho ni ahi hi; na em nuom teng uh emin na huon nuom teng uh huon unlen, zingmawng dongin na khamval teng uh koicing un,’ ci hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate in Moses’ thupieh bangin zingmawng dongin tuate a koicing uhi; tuale tuate pen ui zong ui loin than zong tu lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Moses in, “Tuni pen Topa dinga sabbath ahi ziehin tuni-in tuate ne un; tuni-in gamlahah tuate na mu sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ni guh sung tuate na khawm ding uhi; ahi vangin a ni sagina sabbath ni-in bangma om lo ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A ni sagi ni-in an khawm dingin mi pawlkhat a pei vua, bangma a mu mintah sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Topa in Moses kungah, “Ka thupiehte le ka thuhilte bang tanvei ei niel sawm na hi uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />En un! Topa in na tung vuah sabbath ang pie zo ta hi, tua ahi ziehin ama in ni guh ni-in na tung vuah ni ni khom ding an ang pie hi; a koima po na opna ciet vuah om un; a ni sagi ni-in na opna panun heima pusuoh sih un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuaci’n a ni sagi ni-in mite a toi om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Israel innkuon in tua khu manna a ci uhi; tua khu nannan tang tawh kibangin a meel kang a, khuoizu tawh kibawl mopheng tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Moses in, “ Topa’ thupieh tami ahi hi: ‘Egypt leitang panin kang peipi lai-un amate in senel gamah note kang vana an a mu thei nadingun na khang tungtawnun tuate omer dim khat koicing sah un,’ ci hi,” ci-in a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Moses in Aaron kungah, “Beel khat la-in tua sungah manna omer dim khat sung inlen, na khang tawntung vua a kikem zing dingin Topa mai-ah tuate koi in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Topa in Moses a thupiehsa bangin Aaron in thuciemna mai-ah kepcing dingin tuate koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />A ten nading uh leitang a tun masang uh, kum sawmli sung Israel-te in manna a ne uhi; Canaan gamgi a tun masangun amate in manna a ne uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Omer khat pen ephah khat’ sesawm-suo-sekhat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa’ thupiehsa bangin Israel mi buppi Sin senel gam panin Israel mi buppi a banbanin khuol a zin uhi. Amate in Rephidim-ah giephuol a sat uhi, ahi vangin khum munah mite dawn ding tui om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Moses tawh mite a kihau vua, “Ka dawn ding uh tui ei pie’n,” a ci uhi. Moses in a kung vuah, “Bang dinga kei nei phin uh ahei? Bang dinga Topa na zelah uh ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahi vangin khum munah tui du-in mite a dangta uhi; tuale Moses tungah mite phunin, “Bang dinga dangta-a si dingin Egypt panin kote, ka tate ule ka ganhingte uh ei peitopi na hei,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuaci’n Topa tungah Moses kiko a, “Tam mite bang ka law ta diei? Suong tawh ei seplia dinga kisa ahi ta uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa in Moses kungah, “Israel upate pawlkhat zawpi inlen mite mai-ah pei in; na khut sungah Nile gun na satna ciengkhut tawi inlen pei in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Horeb-a suongpi tung na mai-ah keima ka na ding ding hi. Tua suongpi sat lacin mite dawn thei dingin tua suongpi panin tui ang phul ding hi. Israel upate muna-ah tua bang ma-in Moses a gamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in khum mun pen Massah le Meribah ci-in a min phuo hi, bang ding ahei cile Israel-te in, “Eite’ lahah Topa a om amah, a om sih ahei,” ci-in a kihau vua, amate in Topa a zelah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ciengin Amalek-te kuonin Rephidim-ah Israel-te tawh a kido uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Moses in Joshua kungah, “Eite dingin mi pawlkhat teelin Amalek-te do dingin kuon in. Keima in zing ciengin ka khut sungah Pasien’ ciengkhut tawi-in muol dawnah ka ding ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuaci’n Moses’ gensa ma bangin Joshua gamta a, muoldawn ah Moses, Aaron, le Hur-te a kato laitahun Amalek-te tawh a kido uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Moses in a khut a sangkhai laisie Israel-te in a zo vua, a khut a niemkhieh ciengin Amalek-te in a zo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahi vangin Moses a khut a kham hi. Tuaci’n amate in suongtum khat la-in ama’ nei-ah a koi vua, tua suong tungah Moses a tosah uhi. Aaron le Hur-te, khat langkhatah, a khat a lang khatah pangin a khut gel a dom uhi; tuaci’n nitum cieng dongin a khut gel kipden hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Joshua in Amalek le ama’ mite namsau tawh a zo gawp hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in Moses kung ah, “Ciemtena ahi dingin laibu sungah tami thu giel inlen, Joshua’ zahin tua thu sim in: Keima in vansin nei panin Amalek-te kiphawna ka phietmai ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Moses in maitam khat lam a, tua khu Topa in keima’ zawna diel ahi hi, ci-in a min phuo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama in, “ Topa’ zawna diel tunga khut! Topa in a khang khangin Amalek-te a do ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pasien in Moses le a mi Israel-te dinga a sepna teng le, Topa in Egypt panin Israel-te a peipina thu zosie Moses’ sungpa, Midian siempu Jethro in a unin a za sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Moses in a zi Zipporah a peisah zaw ciengin a sungpa Jethro in ama le
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />a tapa nite a la hi. A khat pen’ min Gershom ahi hi. (azieh pen ama in, “Gamdangah pemta ka hi hi,” a ci hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />tuale adang khat’ min Eliezer ahi hi. (azieh pen ama in, “Ka pa’ Pasien in keima ei hupa ahi a, Pharoah’ namsau panin kei ei hun hi,” a ci hi).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Moses’ sungpa Jethro in senel gam Pasien’ muol tunga Moses in giephuol a satna mun, ama kungah Moses’ tapate le a zi a peipi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in Moses kungah, “Keima, na sungpa Jethro, na zi le na tapa gel tawh na kungah kang pei hi,” ci-in kam vaihlah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A sungpa tawh kimu dingin Moses a pei hi; a mai-ah kunin ama nam hi; a ni tuohun dam ii ci-in kihopi-in puonbuh sungah a lut uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ciengin Moses in a sungpa kungah, Topa in Israel-te a khuolna tawh Pharaoh le Egypt-te tunga a bawlsa zosie, amate in lampi-a a tuokhah uh hahsatna zosie le Topa in amate a hutkhietna thu zosie a unpi-in a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Egypt-te khut sung panin amate a hutkhietna, le Israel-te tunga Topa in a bawl sil hoi bangkim ziehin Jethro a lungdam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jethro in, “Egypt-te le Pharaoh khut sung panin note ang hunkhie Topa in thupha nga taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa pen pasien zosie sanga a lietzawh lam tu-in ka thei hi, azieh pen Egypt-te in Israel-te tungah kiphatsahna tawh a gamtat lai-un amate na hunkhie hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Moses’ sungpa Jethro in Pasien mai-ah meihal biehna le biehpiehnate a peipi hi; tuale Moses’ sungpa tawh Pasien mai-a an neton dingin Aaron le Israel upa zosie a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A zing ni-in mite tunga thu khen dingin Moses a to a, zingmawng panin nitah dongin a kimkotah mite a ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Moses’ sungpa in mite dinga a sepna zosie a unpi-in a mu bepin ama in, “Mite dinga na nasep tami khu a bang bep ahiei? Nang ngentang mawh gumto-in na kimvelah bang dinga mite nitang tuma na dinsah ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Moses in a sungpa kungah, “Azieh pen Pasien’ deina kanin ka kungah mite ang pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kisietna khatpo a nei ciengun keima kungah amate ang pei-in khatlekhat kikalah thu ka khenpieh a, Pasien’ ngaina kipte le amate kungah ama’ dei lamte ka theisah hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Moses’ sungpa in ama kungah, “Na nasep dan a hoi vawt sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nangma le na mite, na ni tuohun na gim seng ding uhi. Bangzieh ahei cile nang adingin tua nasep gih luo hi; nang guohin na sem zo sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tu-in ka kamteng ngai in. Thuhoi hing mop vangin, Pasien in nang hing om pi taheh! Mipi tangin Pasien mai-ah na ding ding a, Pasien mai-ah a kilung nopmawnate uh na tut ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Pasien’ ngaina kipte le a dei lamte amate na hil ding a, a vazin ding ule a na sepdan dingte uh na theisah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mipi lah panin Pasien a zatah mi, a muontah mi, guhgol a muda mi, na sem thei mipilte na sui ding hi; tua bang mite pen a tul, a za, a sawmnga, a sawmte tungah ulienin na koi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amate in mite’ thu khensah tawntung in. Thu thupi teng zosie na kungah kipuohsah inlen, ahi vangin thuneu bepte amau le amau khensah lel in. Tua hile nangma dingin ang baizaw deu ding a, amate in na vangih ang puohpi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Pasien’ sawl bangin tam banga na sep leh na puo zo ding a, tam mite zosie a inn ciet vuah lungnuomin a pei ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuaci’n Moses in a sungpa’ thu ngai-in a gen zosie a unin a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Moses in Israel zosie sung panin nasem thei mipilte teelin mipi tunga lutangte le, a tul, a za, a sawmnga, le a sawmte tunga vaihawm ulienin amate a koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mite tungah amate in thu a khen tawntung uhi; Moses kungah thuhahsate beh a tut vua, ahi vangin thuneu bepte amate in a khentawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua ciengin Moses in a sungpa peisah a, a gamah ama a peikia hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Egypt leitang panin Israel-te a peikhiet zaw uh a hla thumna khum ni ma-in amate Sinai senel gam a tung uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Rephidim panin amate khuolzinin Sinai senel gamah a lut vua, tua senel gamah giephuol a sat uhi; Israel-te in khumi muna muol mai-ah giephuol a sat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ciengin Pasien kungah Moses peito hi; Topa in muol panin ama lhanin ama kungah, “Jacob’ innkuonte le Israel-te kungah tam bangin na gen ding hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Egypt-te tunga ka bawlna le muvanlai’ hla tungah hing puo-in ka kunga kang tut na mu zo ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin tu-in ka thu mangin ka thuciemna na zui uleh mi namcin lah panin keima’ gou nei manpha na hi ding uhi. A tahtahin leitung vannuoi keima- a’ hi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />hinanle note na hi ule keima dingin siempu minam, le minam siengtho na hi ding uhi. Tam teng khu Israel-te kunga na gen ding uh thute ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaci’n Moses pei-in mipi upate hlan a, Topa in ama a thupieh tam thu zosie amate mai-ah a sung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mi zosie in, “ Topa’ gensa poma ka sem ding uhi,” ci-in lung kituohin a dawng uhi. Moses in Topa kungah mite’ thugente a tut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in Moses kungah, “Kang hopi ciengin mite in a zah thei nading ule ang muon zing nadingun na kunga meii sapi sungah kang pei ding hi,” a ci hi. Topa kungah Moses in mite’ thugente a gen ciengin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa in Moses kungah, “Mite kungah va pei ta’nlen tuni le zing sung tengin amate siensuo in. A puonsilte uh sawpsah inlen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />a ni thum ni adingin kithawisah in, bangzieh ahei cile a ni thum ni-in mi zosie’ mu-in Sinai muol tungah Topa ang kumsuh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mite adingin a kimvelah dai na kai ding a, ‘Muol tungah kato loin, a muolmong zong na thamkhah lo nadingun kidawm un. Tua muol a thamkha poma kithat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Koima’ khut in ama thamkha lo ding a, ahi vangin suong tawh ama kiseplia-in ahi sihle thaltangte tawh ama kikaplia ding hi; ganhing hile mihing hile kihinkhawi lo ding hi,’ na ci ding hi. Pengkul sawt veipi a kimut ciengin muol tungah amate a kato ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaci’n muol tung panin mite kungah Moses kumsuh hi. Ama in mite siensuo a, amate in a puonte a sawp uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama in mite kungah, “A ni thum ni adingin kithawi un; numei gei-ah pei sih un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A ni thum ni zingmawngin van to-in tun phe a, muol tungah meii sapi a om hi. Pengkul kimut gin a ngai seng ziehin giephuol a om mi zosie a citun uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pasien tawh kimu dingin giephuol panin Moses in mite a zawpi hi. Muol bulah amate a ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tu-in mei sung tua muol tungah Topa a kumsuh ziehin meikhu in Sinai Muol a tuommang hi; meikhuh sunga meikhu bangin a tung lamah meikhu kileh to a, tua laitahin tua muol buppi nahpitahin kiling hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pengkul aw a nah gin semsem laitahin Moses in hopi a, Pasien in vanto lahah ama a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sinai muol vumah Topa a kumsuh ciengin muol tungah Topa in Moses hlan a, tuale Moses a peito hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in Moses kungah, “Kumsuh inlen, Topa en dingin mite in tua daithaw a kansan lo nadingun va hilkhol ta’n; tua hi sihle amate lah panin mi tampi in a silaw ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Topa lam a neh siempute na ngawn zong kisiensuo tawmsah in. Tua ahi sihle amate tungah Topa lungthah ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Moses in Topa kungah, “Sinai muol tungah mite kikato sah lo hi; azieh pen nang mama in kote nei hilkhol a, ‘Muol kimvelah dai kai inlen siengthosah in,’ nei ci hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Topa in ama kungah, “Kumsuh inlen Aaron hing zawpito in; ahi vangin siempute ahi a, mite ahi zongin Topa kunga pei dingin daithaw hing kalsah sin; a tua ci teitei uleh a tung vuah ama lungthah ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuaci’n mipi lamah Moses kumsuhin a kung vuah a gen hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin Pasien in tam thu teng a gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kei pen saltanna gam Egypt pana ang peipi Topa na Pasien uh ka hi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />keima mai-ah pasien dangte na nei sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Noma adingin tung lama vantung hile, nei-a leitung hile, leisiet nei-a om tuisung hile a om na khat popo tawh a kisun milim na bawl sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuate mai-ah na kun sih ding vua, tuate na bie sih ding uhi; bang ding ahei cile kei pen note’ Topa Pasien, a thangsie Pasien ka hi a, kei ei nuolte tungah a pate uh’ khielna, a khang thumna le a khang lina dongin, a tate uh tungah dan a pie Pasien ka hi hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />ahi vangin keima ei it a, ka thupieh a zui mite’ suonlehlah tungah khang tul khatna dongin itna kip a lah pa ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa na Pasien uh’ min a sie lamin na zang sih ding uhi, azieh pen ama’ min a zang khiel poma Topa in maw pengsah lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sabbath ni phawh unlen a siengtho-in tang un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ni guh sungin na nasep ding zosie uh na sem ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahi vangin a ni sagi ni pen Topa na Pasien uh’ sabbath ni ahi hi. Nang, na tapa, na tanu, na sila pa, na sila nu, na ganhingte ahi sihle na khuo sung vua pemtate in bangma na na sem sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile ni guh sungin Topa in van le lei, tuipi le tuate sunga a om sil zosie bawl hi, hinanle a ni sagi ni-in a tawlnga hi; tua ziehin Topa in sabbath ni thupha pie-in siengthosah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa na Pasien un na tung vua ang pieh leitangah na hin sawt thei nadingun na nu le na pa zatah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mi na that sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ang na kawm sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na na gu sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na vengte lang khatah a manlo teci na pang sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na vengte’ inn na deigaw sih ding uhi; na vengte’ zi hile, a sila pasal hile, a sila numei hile, a bawngtang hile, a laa hile, na vengte’ na khat popo na deigaw sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mi zosie in vanto le tunphe, pengkul gin, le muola meikhu a mu ciengun zau-in a ling vua, gamlapi-ah a ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />tuale Moses kungah, “Kote ei hopi in, na thugen ka ngai ding uhi. Ahi vangin Pasien in ei hopi sah sin. Nei hopi sah mawh leh ka si ta ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Moses in mite kungah, “Zau sih un. Bang ding ahei cile ama zahtahin na maw lo nadingun note zelah dinga Pasien ang pei ahi zaw hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ciengin Moses in Pasien’ opna khuomiel sapi lam a neh laitahin a gamla-ah mite a ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Topa in Moses kungah tam bangin gen hi: Israel-te kungah tam bangin na gen ding hi: “Vantung panin kang hopina noma ma in na thei zo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kei tawh kopin ngun pasien-te na bawl sih ding vua, noma adingin kham pasien-te zong na bawl sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Keima dingin lei maitam khat beh na bawl uh a ngai a, tuami tungah na meihal biehnate ule thunuoma na biehnate uh ahi na tuute ule na bawngtangte utawh biehpiehna pie un; ka min ka kiphawsahna muncin tenga na kung vuah keima hing pei-in thupha kang pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahi vangin keima dingin suong maitam khat nei bawlpieh vua ahile tua khu a kisehsa suongte tawh na bawl sih ding uh; azieh pen tua tungah na sekhu utawh na suhkhah uleh a buasah na hi ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Na guohtang opna teng uh a kidaw lo nadingin ka maitam tungah kalei tawh na kato sih ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tam teng pen amate mai-a na pieh ding biehna ngaina kipte ahi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hebrew mi sila khat na lei ciengin ama in kum guh sung na sem ding a, ahi vangin kum sagi a cin ciengin leibat nei loin a suota-in pei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama guoha ang pei ahile ama guoh ma-in peikhie kia ding hi; zi neisa-a ang pei ahile a zi tawh ama peikhie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A pupa in ama zi khat guon a, tua nu in ama tawh tapate ahi a, tanute ahi zongin a nei leh, a zi le a tate pen a pupa-a’ hi ding a, a guohtangin ama a pei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahi vangin sila pa in, “Ka pupa, ka zi, le ka tate ka it ka ngai hi. A suohta-in ka pei sih ding hi,” a ci leh
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />a pupa in Pasien mai-ah ama peipi ding hi. Kotpi-ah ahi a, kotpi khuom-ah ahi zongin ama kipeipi ding hi; tuale a pupa in siatul khat tawh a bil vupieh ding hi; tuale ama in a hin sung tungtawnin ama’ na a sem ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pasal khat in a tanu sila-in a zua leh tua nu pen sila pasalte pei bangin pei lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama dinga a sekholsa tua numei in a pupa a lungkimsah sih leh, ama in tua nu kitansah ding hi; ama in a dih lopi-in tua nu a na bawl ziehin gamdang mite tungah zua theina thu nei lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama in a tapa’ zi dinga tua nu a sesa ahile a tanu khat bangin tua nu bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama in zi dang khat a lah leh a zi masa’ nga ding hamphatnate ahi a anneh, a puonsil le a anglum piehnate a khiem tuon sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama in tua nu dingin tam thu thum teng a bawl sih leh leibat nei lo, sum pieh kul loin pei thei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi khat satin a sisah poma kithat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua khu a sawmhlim ahi sih a, Pasien’ nasepna tawh a pieng ahi zawh leh tuol thatpa a tai thei nading note dingin mun khat ka koi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahi vangin mi khat in midang khat tha sawmin a kihaupi a, lebawlna tawh tua pa a tha leh thalia pai dingin ka maitam panin tua mithat pa na kaiphit ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A pa hile a nu hile a vuo poma kithat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mi khat a gu poma, tua a kigu mipa a kizua zosa ahi a, ama kunga omlai ahi zongin kithat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A pa ahi sihle a nu samsie poma kithat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mite kihau a, khat in adang khat suong tawh sepin, ahi sihle a khuttum tawh a tup a, a mi suhkhah pa a si lo vangin lupmun tung ngahin omin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />ahi vangin ama pongdawh kia a, ciengkhut tawh a pulam a vakhiet kawi zo leh, a liempa’ a thasup hun tangin sum pie-in a dam dongin a kep ding ci simlo, a mawna panin tua mivuo pa a peng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sila nei pa in sila pasal ahi a, sila numei ahi zongin khat moltum tawh satin tua sila pa a phuolsi pai leh, a nei pa dan kipie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahi vangin ni khat ahi a, ni ni ahi zongin tua sila a hin leh, ama dan kipie lo ding hi; azieh pen tua sila pa khu ama’ neisa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mite kihau-in nupi gailai khat liemsahin a ta a tol a, hinanle liemna dang khat in a nuathuol nawn sih po leh, a liemsah mipa pen nupi nu’ pasal nget zaza tawh kigaam ding a, lieusum pen thukhen mangte’ ciengtan zaza pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Sietna khatpo in a thuolkia leh hinna tangin hinna,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />mittang tangin mittang, ha tangin ha, khut tangin khut, keng tangin keng,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />meikah tangin meikah, liemna tangin liemna, vuohna tangin vuohna pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Sila nei pa in sila pa ahi a, sila nu ahi zongin a mit satin a suhsiet leh, a mit lieuman dingin tua sila pa a suohta-in peisah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Sila nei pa in a sila pasal ahi a, a sila numei ahi zongin a hatang khat a suhtawng leh, a ha lieuman dingin sila pa a suohta-in peisah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Bawngtang khat in pasal ahi a, numei ahi zongin a ki tawh a pihlia leh suong tawh tua bawngtang kiseplia ding a, a sa kine lo ding hi; ahi vangin tua bawngtang nei pa pen mawna tawh kipeng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A tawpsa hunin zong tua bawngtang in mipih zongsang a, a neipa kihil napi tua bawng a khum tuon sih a, tuale pasal khat ahi a, numei khat ahi zongin a thalia leh, tua bawngtang zong kiseplia ding a, a nei pa zong kithat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A nei pa tungah luongman a kinget leh a nei pa in ama’ hinna tat nadingin sum kingen zaza pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua bawngtang in tangval khat ahi a, ngahnu khat ahi zongin a ki tawh a pih leh, a nei pa tungah tam bang dan ma-in kibawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Bawngtang in sila pa khat ahi a, sila nu khat ahi zongin a ki tawh a pih leh, a nei pa in sila nei pa tungah ngun shekel sawmthum pie ding a, tua bawngtang suong tawh kiseplia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Mi khat in dum honsa-in nuasie-in, ahi sihle dum khat to-in tua dum sin loin a koi a, tua dum sungah bawngtang khat ahi a, laa khat ahi zongin a kieh leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />dum nei pa in a manh za lieu-in, ama in a nei pa sum pie ding a, ahi vangin tua ganhing sisa pen ama in tang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Mi khat’ bawngtang in adang khat’ bawngtang liemsahin tua bawngtang a si leh amate in bawngtang a hinglai pen zua-in a manh a hawm ding uhi; tuale amate in ganhing sisa pen zong hawm ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ahi vangin tua bawngtang pen a tawpsa hunin mi pih a na zongsangsa ahi a, a nei pa thu kihil napi tua bawngtang a khum sih leh, a nei pa in bawngtang tangin bawngtang ma tawh lo ding a, ahi vangin ama in ganhing sisa pen tang ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mi khat in bawngtang khat ahi sihle tuu khat gu a, tuale that a, go ahi sihle a zua leh, guta pa in bawngtang khat tangin bawngtang nga, le tuu khat tangin tuu li pie ding hi. (3b) Guta pa in ditkiana bawl ding a, hizongle tua banga a bawl zawh sih leh a guhtat ziehin ama kizua ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />(4) A kigu ganhing pen bawngtang ahi a, laa ahi a, tuu ahi zongin guta pa khut sungah a hingin a kimu leh guta pa in a za ni-in dinkia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Guta khat a inn lu laitah kimu-in a si nading za-in kisat leh tua sisan luonna ziehin mawna om lo hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />(3a) ahi vangin tua pen ni suo zawa pieng thu ahile sisan luonna ziehin mawna a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi khat in lo khatah ahi a, lengga lo-ah ahi zongin gan tasahin ahi sihle midang khat’ lolai-ah gan hla-in a tatsah leh, a lo ahi sihle a lengga lo pana a pieng ga hoipen tawh ditkiana bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mei in gamlah a law a, bu a ki-atsa kikholvumte ahi a, bukungte ahi zongin a kahtum leh, mei hal masa pa in a cing tahin dinkia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi khat in a vengpa kungah sum ahi sihle vante kep dingin ap a, a vengpa’ inn panin tuate kigumangin, tua guta pa a kimat leh ama in a za ni-in dinkia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Guta pa a kimat sih leh inn nei pa in a vengpa’ vante tungah a khut a nga amah a nga sih ahei ci thu a kitel nadingin Pasien mai-ah inn nei pa kipeipi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Neisa kituna thu khat popo ah, bawngtang, laa, tuu, puonsil, ahi sihle a mang na khat popo, mi khat in, “Tam kei-a’ hi,” a cina tungtangah, Pasien mai-ah alang nite’ thu kitut ding hi; Pasien in a mawsah mipa in a khat pa tungah a za ni-in lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mi khat in midang khat tungah laa, bawngtang, tuu, ahi sihle ganhing dang khat popo a kep dingin a ap a, tua gan a si ahi a, a liem ahi a, a kikaimang ahi zongin koima in a mu sih leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />khat pa in a khat’ neisa tungah ka khut ka ngah tah leh ci-in Topa mai-ah kiciemna tawh ama ni kikalah thu kikhen ding hi; a nei pa in tua kiciemna khu a sang ding a, ditkiana kibawl lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahi vangin tua a vante a kigu ahile a nei pa kidinkia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Gamsa neh ahile teci dingin tua gan peipisah in; tua ganhing nehmawh teng pen kilokia lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mi khat in midang khat’ gan khat a kawm a, a nei pa op lo kalin tua ganta liemin ahi sihle a si leh a kicingin ditkiana kinei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A nei pa a op leh ditkiana kinei lo ding hi. A kikawm ahile kawm manh beh kingen ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pasal khat in kinunpi dinga zuthawl kipie nai lo ngahnu khat zawlin a luppi leh tua nu’ manh dingin moman pie ding a, zi-in la pai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahi vangin a pa in tua nu ama adingin a phal sih leh ama in ngahnu siengthote’ moman za sum pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Dawi-aitawi numeite na hinkhawi sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ganhing a luppi mi poma kithat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Topa beh simlo pasien khat popo tungah biehpiehna a lui poma kisusie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Pemta khat popo tungah tatkhiel loin na gawt sih ding uhi, azieh pen no zong Egypt gamah pemta na hi ngai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Meigong hile taga hile na bawlsie sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amate na bawlsiet vua ka kunga ang kiko uleh keima in amau’ kikona ka za valon ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />ka lungthahna kuongin namsau tawh note kang that ding a, na zite uh meigong suohin na tate uh taga a suoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Na lah vuah a zawng ka mite khat popo tung sum leitawi na pieh uleh a tung vuah sum leitawi a pie pa bangin na om sih ding uhi; note in amate tung panin a met na la sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Na vengpa ang pon puon na lah leh, nitum masangin ama kungah tua puon na piekia ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />bang ding ahei cile tua khu na vengpa in a kihui nadinga a zah a puon nei sun hi kha thei ding hi; bang silin tua mipa a kimu ta ding ahei? Keima kungah na vengpa ang kiko leh keima in ka za ding hi, azieh pen kei mi lainat siem pa ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Pasien na gensie sih ding vua, na mite tunga makaipa na samsie sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Na anlahna pan ule na lengga suhna pan vua ang letdawhte panin biehna pieh ding na kiheh sih ding uhi. Keima tungah na tacilte uh nei pie ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Na bawngtangte ule na tuute uh panin zong tua ma bangin nei pie ding uhi: Ni sagi sung api tawh om ding hi; a ni giet ni-in kei tungah nei pie ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Note pen keima tunga ang kisiensuote na hi uhi; tua ahi ziehin gamlahah gamsa in a nehsa ganhing sa kici na ne sih ding uhi; note in uite na pie ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A man lo thu na thezah sih ding uhi. Elna tawh teci pang dingin mi gilote tawh na kikhut zop sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sietna bawl dingin mi a tamzaw’ thu na zui sih ding uhi; thu kineina-ah teci na pan ciengun mi a tamzaw lamah pangin thutang na lehei sih ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />thu kineina-ah mizawngte zong na angvan tuom sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na galte uh’ bawngtang hile a laa hile a gammang na tuokhah uleh na puohkia ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Note ang muda pa khat’ laa a van tawh a pua na mu uleh na peisan mawh sih ding vua, a keng tawh a dinkia thei nadingin na hu ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na mipi a zawngte thu kineina tungtangah thutang na lehei sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A man lo pi-a mi mawsahna khu a gamlapi-ah pelh unlen, maw nei lo pa le midih pa that sih un. Bang ding ahei cile keima in a tatkhiel pa ka suohta sah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Guhgol sum in uliente’ mit tawsah a, thuman mite’ thu a lehei ziehin guhgol na la sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pemta khat na gawt sih ding uhi; note in pemta’ lungsim na thei uhi, azieh pen note zong Egypt gamah pemta na hi ngai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kum guh sung na lo vuah khai tu-in a piengte na kaikhawm ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />ahi vangin a kum sagina ciengin na mipi uh a zawngte in a neh thei nadingun leitang na tawlngasahin hlaw loin lo na khul ding uhi; gamsate in amate’ nuasie teng ne ding uhi. Na lengga lote ule na olive lote uzong tua bang ma-in na bawl ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ni guh sung na nasep na sem ding vua, ahi vangin na bawngtangte ule na laate uh a khawl thei nading le, na inn sung vua a suoh silate le pemtate in tha tha a nga thei nadingun a ni sagi ni-in na tawlnga ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na kung vua kang gensa zosie thusim unlen, pasien dangte’ min lo kha sih un; na kam panun tuate kizasah sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Keima adingin kum khatin pawi thumvei na bawl ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tolsaw lo anlum pawi na bawl ding uhi; keima in kang thupieh bangin Abib hla a kisesa hunin ni sagi sung tol saw lo anlum na ne ding uhi, bangzieh ahei cile tua hla sungin Egypt panin note na peikhie uhi. Ka mai-ah khutguoh tawh koima ang kilaa lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lo sunga na tu uh, na na sepna uh a ga masate tawh anlah pawi na bawl ding uhi. Lo sunga khaici na tu hun vua kipanin na sepna uh a ga na kaikhop uh kum tawp ciengin an kaikhopna pawi na bawl ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Topa Pasien mai-ah na pasal zosie uh kum khatin thumvei kilaa ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tol kisawsa sil khat popo tawh ka biehpiehna si na pieton sih ding vua, ahi sihle ka pawi-a kipie a thaute zingmawng dongin na omsah sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Topa na Pasien uh’ inn ah leitanga pieng na anpal uh a hoi pen na peipi ding uhi. Api’ nawizu tawh keelno na huontha sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka bawlsa munah note ang peipi ding le lamkalah ang cing dingin na mai vuah vantungmi khat ka sawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama thusimin ama’ aw ngai un; ama ledo sih un. Ama sungah ka min om ahi ziehin ama in na thu palsatte uh ang maisah sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama’ aw limtahin ngai-in ka thu gen zosie na sep uleh na galte’ gal ka hi ding a, na langte’ lang ka hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Na mai vuah ka vantungmi pei-in Amor-te, Hit-te, Perez-te, Canaan-te, Hiv-te le Jebus-te kungah hing peipi-in, amate ka phietmang ciengin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />a pasien-te uh’ mai-ah kun loin, a na uzong sem loin, amau’ gamtat bangin na gamta sih ding vua, a pasien-te uh suhsiet piehin a milim khuompite uh na satguoi pieh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Topa na Pasien uh na bie ding vua, keima in na an ule na tui uh thupha ka pie ding hi; keima in note lah panin natna ka lamang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Na gam sung vuah nausie le a ciing koima om lo ding hi; keima in note kang vuoisi sah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Na mai vuah ka zauhuoina ka sawl ding a, na phuhkhah ding mi zosie lungbuoisahin, na kung panun na galte zosie kihei-in ka taisah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Keima in na mai panun Hiv-te, Canaan-te le Hit-te a notmang dingin natna ka sawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Leitang gamkhing suohin na langkhat vuah gamsa ang tam luo ding ahi ziehin kum khat sungin na mai panun amate ka notmang sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Khumi gam a luo khop ding za-a na tam masangun na mai panun them khat khatin amate ka delmang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />San Tuipi panin Philistia-te’ tuipi dong le senel gam panin Euphrates gun dongin na gamgi uh ka phut ding hi; bangzieh ahei cile keima in na khut sung vuah tua gama tengte kang pie ding a, na mai vuah amate na delmang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Amate le a pasien-te utawh thuciemna na bawl sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Na gam sung vuah amate teng lo ding hi. Tua hi sihle amate in kei tungah note ang mawsah ding uhi; bang ding ahei cile a pasien-te uh na bieh uleh tua khu note dingin thangkam khat ang hi tahtah ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua cieng in ama in Moses kungah, “Nangma le Aaron, Nadab, Abihu le Israel upate sawm sagi tawh Topa kungah peito unlen, a gamla panin bie un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa nai-ah Moses beh pei ding hi; ama’ nai-ah adangte a pei sih ding vua, ama tawh mite peito lo ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Moses a pei a, ama in Topa’ thugen zosie le biehna ngaina zosie, mipie kungah a gen hi; mi zosie in kituoh tahin a dawng vua, “ Topa’ thu gen zosie ka bawl ding uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuale Topa’ thugen zosie Moses in a giel hi. Ama zingmawngin thobai-in muol bulah maitam khat lam a, Israel minam sawm le nite tawh kituohin khuom sawm le ni phut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama in Topa tungah meihal biehna le thunuoma biehnate a lui dingin Israel khangnote a sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Moses in gansi alang la-in kuong sungah koi a, maitam tungah gansi alang the hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in thuciemna laibu la a, mipite’ zahin tua laibu a sim hi. Tuale amate in, “ Topa’ thugen zosie bawlin thu ka mang ding uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Moses in gansi la-in mipi tungah the a, ama in, “Tami thu zosie tawh kizui-in Topa in note tawh a bawlsa thuciemna sisan en un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ciengin Moses le Aaron, Nadab, Abihu le Israel upate mi sawm sagi a peito vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />tuale amate in Israel’ Pasien a mu uhi. A keng nei-ah a sienthona van mel tawh kibang, sapphire suongmanpha tawh a kibawl suongpha bang dan khat om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Israel makaite tungah Pasien in a khut ngam lo hi; amate in zong Pasien a mu vua, an ne tui dawnin a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa in Moses kungah, “Muol tunga keima kungah hing peito inlen, tua tahah ei na ngah in; amate lam lah nadinga ka gielsa thukham le thupieh kigielna suongpehte kang pie ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuaci’n a nasempa Joshua tawh Moses dingkhie a, Pasien’ muol tungah Moses a peito hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama in upate kungah, “Na kung vua kang peikia masangun tam sungah ei ngah un; azieh pen note tawh Aaron le Hur a om hi; thu nei popo ama gel kungah pei thei hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ciengin muol tungah Moses peito a, meei in muol a tuom hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa’ vanglietna Sinai Muol tungah kumsuh a, meei in ni sagi sung tua muol a tuomcip hi; a ni sagi ni-in ama in meei lah panin Moses hlan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tu-in Topa’ vanglietna ang kilah dan pen Israel mite’ muna-ah muol vuma a katum mei tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Meii lahah Moses lut a, muol tungah a peito hi. Sun sawmli le zan sawmli sung muol tungah Moses a thaam hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Moses kungah tam bangin gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Keima ading biehna ang peipi nadingun Israel-te kungah gen in; alungtang sungah a pie nuom mi zosie tung panin kei adingin biehna na sang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate tung pana na san ding biehna khu tam teng ahi hi: Kham, ngun, sumngo,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />a dum, a dupsan, le a ausan puonte le hoitaha kigan puonte, keelmul,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />a sana kibum tuutang vunte, savun kizutnem sa, gising,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />meivahte ading sathau, nu sathau ding le gimnamtui dingin sil namtuite,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />siempu puon le awmdal-a kikhai ding suongsan le onyx suongte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amate lahah ka ten thei nadingin kei adingin amate mun siengtho khat bawlsah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Biehbuh le a vanzah zosie’ lim dan ding tawh kisai-in na kunga kang lah zosie tawh kituohin na bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amate in gising tawh singkuong khat bawl ding uhi; adung tong ni le alang, avai tong khat le khap, a sanna tong khat le khap hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nangma in kham citah tawh tuami singkuong a sung a puo na zut ding a, a tung kimvelah kham tawh a geihuol na bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nangma in tua singkuong adingin kham kuol li sungin singkuong keng lite tungah tuate na bul ding a, apang khatah kuol ni, apang lang khatah kuol ni ma na bul ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Gising singzawl na sui ding a, kham tawh tuate na zut ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Singkuong puoh nadingin singkuong panga a kuolte sungah a zawlte na siet ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Singkuong’ bilte sungah zawlte om suoh ding hi; tuate kilakhie lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nangma in singkuong sungah kang pieh ding thuciemna na koi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ciengin kham citah tawh hepina topha! khat na bawl ding hi; adung tong ni le khap, avai tong khat le khap hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kham Cherub ni na bawl ding hi; hepina topha mong tuohah a kikheng tua Cherub-te na omsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Among khatah Cherub khat bawl inlen, among lang khatah Cherub khat ma bawl in; among tuohah Cherub-te na bawl ding a, tuate hepina topha tawh sakhatin na bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cherub-te in a tung lamah a hlate zahin, a hlate tawh hepina topha lie suhin khatlekhat kimaingat ding hi; Cherub-te’ maitang in hepina topha lam nga ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Singkuong tungah hepina topha na koi ding a, singkuong sungah nangma kang pieh ding thuciemna na koi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hepina topha tung, thuciemna singkuong tunga om Cherub nite kikal panin nang kang kimupi ding a, khumi munah Israel-te adinga ka thupiehte zosie a unpi-in nangma tungah kang pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Gising tawh sabuoi khat na bawl ding a, adung tong ni, avai tong khat, a sanna tong khat le khap hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kham citah tawh tua sabuoi na zut ding a, a kimvelah kham tawh a geihuol na bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Sabuoi kimvelah avai khutpeh cie a pha zawlpeh khat na bawl ding a, tua zawlpeh kimvelah kham tawh a geihuol na bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua sabuoi adingin kham kuol li na bawl ding a, a ning li, a keng lite-ah na hen ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Sabuoi zawn nading zawlte a tu dingin a zawlpeh gei-ah a kuolte om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Gising tawh zawlte bawlin kham tawh na zut ding a, tamte tawh sabuoi kizawng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Gimnamtui adingin kuongdaite le pakante, dawn thei biehna sun nadingin thawlte le haite na bawl ding hi; kham citah tawh tuate na bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Keima’ mai sabuoi tungah Ompina Anlum na koi zing ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Kham citah tawh meivah tunna khat na bawl ding hi. Meivah tunna bul le a kungte pen sehta tawh kikhensa hi ding hi; a haite, a nunte le a papete tua tawh kisamat ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />a pangte panin ba guh meng ding a, a pang khatah meivah tunna ba thum mengin, a pang lang khatah meivah tunna ba thum ma meng ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />a ba khat ciet tungah a nun le a pape a om almond ga tawh a kibang hai thum, le adang ba khat ciet tungah a nun le a pape a om almond ga tawh a kibang hai thum ma om ding a, meivah tunna panin a ba guh mengkhie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tua meivah tunna tung mama-ah a nunte le pape khat ciet a nei almond ga tawh a kibang hai li om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />A kopa a menkhietna a masa pen nei-ah a nun khat om ding a, a kop nina nei-ah a nun khat ma om ding hi. A kop tawpna nei-ah a nun khat om ding a, meivah tunna panin a ba guh mengkhie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />A nunte le a bate kisamat ding a, a unpi-in kham citah tawh kikheng hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ama adingin meivah sagi na bawl ding hi; a mai teng a tanvah dingin meivahte kikoi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />A meitena taite le a dopna kuongte kham citah hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />A umlebeel zosie kham citah talent khat tawh kibawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Muol tunga kang lah lim dan bangbanga tuate na bawl ding ahi lam thei in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua tham loin a kop-a kihiaton vau hoi tawh a kigan a dum, a dupsan le a ausan dalna puon sawm le a dum, a dupsan le a ausan khaute tawh biehbuh na bawl ding hi; khutsiemte in a bawl cherub-te tawh tuate na bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Dalna puon pen adung tong sawmni le giet ciet hi ding a, avai tong li ciet hi ding hi; dalna puon zosie a unpi-in kikim ciet ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Dalna puon ngate khatlekhat kikhuituo ding hi; adang dalna puon ngate zong khatlekhat kikhuituo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A kikhuituo a masa dalna puon a geita pen’ puonmong gei guolah vaudum tawh a bilvangte na bawl ding hi; tua bang ma-in a kikhuituo a nina dalna puon a geita pen’ puonmong gei guolah a bilvangte na bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Dalna puon khat tungah bilvang sawmnga bawlin, a kikhuituo a nina dalna puon mongah bilvang sawmnga ma na bawl ding hi; a bilvangte khatlekhat kimaingat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Biehbuh buppikhat a suo thei nadingin kham kilna sawmnga bawlin, tua kilnate tawh dalna puonte khatlekhat na kimatsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Biehbuh tunga om puonbuh a tung khu nadingin kelmul tawh a kigan dalna puonte zong na bawl ding hi; dalna puon sawm le khat na bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua dalna puon adung tong sawm thum ciet hi ding a, avai tong li ciet hi ding hi; tua dalna puon sawm le khatte kikim ciet ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Dalna puon ngate ama le ama na kikhuituosah ding a, dalna puon guhte zong khuituo-in a guhna puon pen puonbuh mai-ah na hlip ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A kikhuituo dalna puon a geita pen’ mongah bilvang sawmnga na bawl ding a, a kikhuituo a nina dalna puon geita pen mongah bilvang sawmnga ma na bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Puonbuh buppikhat a suo thei nadingin sumngo kilna sawmnga na bawl ding a, a bilvangte sungah a kilna teng hengin puonbuh na kimatsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Puonbuh puon dalna puon a valkhie, puon alang val pen biehbuh nua lamah kaisuh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Puonbuh puon adung lam, pang khatah tong khat le alang, a pang lang khatah tong khat le alang val pen biehbuh tungkhu dingin tam lampang le khum lampangte-ah kaisuh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A sana kibum tuutang’ vun le kelvun hoite tawh puonbuh khuna na bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Biehbuh adingin a poto ding gising khuompehte na sui ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khuompeh khat adung tong sawm hi ding a, avai tong khat le khap ta hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khuompehte a kibulton thei nadingin khuompeh khatah a zang ni ta om ding hi; biehbuh khuompeh zosie adingin tamte na bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Biehbuh’ khuompehte tam bangin na sui ding hi: Leitaw lampang adingin khuompeh sawmni na sui ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />khuompeh sawmnite zungah ngun tawh kibawl a tunna sawm li na bawl ding a, a zang nite adingin a masa khuompeh zungah a tunna ni, le a bana khuompeh khat zungah a zang nite adingin a tunna ni ma hi ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />biehbuh a pang nina lam, leilu lampanga a om khuompeh sawmnite le
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />ngun tawh a kibawl a tunna sawmli adingin khuompeh khatah a tunna ni, adang khuompeh khat bulah a tunna ni ma hi ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />nitumna lam kinga biehbuh nualam adingin khuompeh guh na sui ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Biehbuh nualam a ningte adingin khuompeh ni na sui ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />tuate pen a nei lamah kikah ding a, hizongle a kuol masa-ah a dawn kimat ding hi; a ni tuohin tua bang hi ding a, tua tegel in a ning ni piengsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ngun tawh a kibawl a tunna sawm le guh adingin khuompeh giet hi ding hi; khuompeh khatah a tunna ni ta om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Gising kotgolte na sui ding a, biehbuh pang khat a khuompeh adingin kotgol nga,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />le biehbuh pang lang khat khuompehte adingin kotgol nga, nitumna lam kinga biehbuh sialam panga khuompehte adingin kotgol nga hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Kotgol a laita khuompeh laikim dong a banto pen mong khat panin mong khat dongin pei suoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Khuompehte kham tawh na zut ding a, kotgolte a tu dingin a kuolte kham tawh na bawl ding hi; kotgolte kham tawh na zut ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tua ciengin muol tunga ang kilahsa gelna bangbangin biehbuh na lam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A dum, a dupsan, a ausan, le a kop-a kihiaton vau hoi tawh a kigan dalna puon khat na bawl ding hi; tua puonte pen cherub-te tawh khutsiem taha kigan hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ngun tawh a kibawl a tunna lite tunga a om, kham vankhaina nei, kham tawh kizut gising khuompi lite tungah tuate na khai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />A kilnate-ah dalna puon khaisuhin, dalna puon sung tua munah thuciemna singkuong na koi ding hi; dalna puon in note dingin a siengtho pen mun le a siengtho mun khen ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hepina topha pen a siengtho pen mun, thuciemna singkuong tungah na koi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Dalna puon pulamah sabuoi na koi ding a, sabuoi tawh a kimaingat biehbuh leitaw lam pangah meivah khuom na koi ding hi; leilu lampangah sabuoi na koi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Puonbuh kotkha dalna puonkhai dingin a dum, a sandup, a ausan, le a kop-a kihiaton vau hoi tawh a kigan, hieu tawh kikhui-in hoi taha kizem khat na bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Kotkhah puonkhai adingin gising khuompi nga bawlin kham tawh na zut ding hi; a vankhainate pen kham hi-in, tuate adingin sumngo tawh a kibawl a tunna nga na bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Adung tong nga, avai tong nga a pha maitam khat na bawl ding hi; tua maitam in a kikim ning li nei-in, tong thum sang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua maitam ning li teng tungah a ki na bawl ding hi; a kite maitam tawh kicimatin sumngo tawh na zut ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Vut khol nading beelte le kawbia-te, kuongte, siakate le vutluona pehte na bawl ding hi; a vanzah zosie sumngo tawh na bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuami-a zah dingin sumngo sialen khat zong na phan ding hi; tua sia-len tunga a ning li tengah sumngo kuol li na vaw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sialen in maitam kimcieng a batsuh thei nadingin maitam zawl nei-ah na bul ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Maitam dingin gising zawlte na bawl ding a, sumngo tawh tuate na zut ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />a kipuoh ciengin maitam pang nite tungah a zawlte a op thei nadingin a kuol vangte sungah a zawlte kikhum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Siapehte tawh maitam a lai pen na hawmsah ding hi. Muol tung nangma kunga ang kilahsa bang lienin tuate kibawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Biehbuh tuol na bawl ding hi. Leitaw lampang in tong zakhat a sau, a kop-a kihiaton vau hoi tawh a kigan a kikhaisuh dalna puonte nei ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />a khuompi sawmni le a tunna sawmni pen sumngo tawh kibawl hi ding a, ahi vangin khuomte tunga vankhainate le a gaanate ngun tawh kibawl hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Leilu lampang zong a sauna tua za ma hi ding a, a kikhaisuh dalna puon tong zakhat hi-in, a khuom sawmni le a tunna sawmnite sumngo tawh kibawl ding a, ahi vangin khuompite tunga vankhainate le a gaanate ngun tawh kibawl hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nitumna lampangah buhtuol a vailam adingin khuom sawm le a tunna sawm tawh tong sawmnga a sau a kikhaisuh dalna puon om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Buhtuol nisuona mailam zong avai tong sawmnga hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pang khatah a kikhaisuh dalna puon tong sawm le nga hi ding a, khuom thum le a tunna thum tawh hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A pang langkhatah a kikhaisuh dalna puon pen tong sawm le nga hi ding a, khuom thum le a tunna thum tawh hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Buhtuol kotpi dingin tong sawmni a sau, a dum, a dupsan, a ausan, a kop-a kihiation vau hoite tawh a kigan, hieu tawh kikhui-in a kizem kot puonkhai khat om ding hi; tua in khuom li le a tunna li nei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Buhtuol kimvela khuom zosie ngun tawh kigah ding hi; a vankhainate ngun hi-in a tunnate sumngo hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Buhtuol adung tong zakhat, avai tong sawmnga, a sanna tong nga hi ding a, a kop-a kihiaton vau hoi tawh a kigan a kikhaisuh dalna puon le sumngo tawh kibawl a tunnate tawh hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Biehbuh sunga vanzah ding poma, a khetphim zosie le buhtuol-a khetphim zosie sumngo tawh kibawl hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Meivah a kuon zing thei nadingin, mei-a vah ding a kigawtguoi olive ga, sathau siengtho, Israel-te in nangma kungah ang tawi nadingin thu na pie lai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua meivah a kuon zing thei nadingin Aaron le a tapate in kikhopna puonbuh sung, thuciemna singkuong mai-a dalna puon pulamah, nitah pan zingmawng dongin Topa mai-ah vil ding uhi. Tua khu a khantan vua Israel-te in a zui ding uh ngaina kip khat hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin keima kunga siempu na a sem dingin Israel-te lah panin na sanggampa Aaron, a tapate- Nadab le Abihu, Eleazar le Ithamar-te tawh, nangma kungah peipi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in thupina a tan thei nadingin na sanggampa Aaron ading puonsil siengthote na bawlpieh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka siempu na sem dinga Aaron a kisiensuo thei nadingin pilna lungtang a nei, bawl thei siemna ka guotsa mi zosie kungah Aaron’ puonte a gatpieh nadingun na gen ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A puon gat dingte uh tam teng ahi hi: Awmdal khat, siempu puon khat, puontuol khat, sih li a nei puonah tungsil pawl bilbiel khat, dielkhim khat le kawnggah khat ahi hi. Keima kunga siempu na a sem ding Aaron le a tapate adingin puonah siengthote a bawl ciengun
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />amate in kham, a dum, a dupsan, a ausan khaute le hoitaha kigan puonte zang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate in kham, a dum, a dupsan, a ausan vaute le a kop-a kihiaton vau hoite tawh khutsiem taha kigan siempu puon bawl ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Siempu puon pen a liengko-a khikip nadingin among nite-ah a kimat liengkaih puon ni nei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuami tunga a om a kizem kawnggah zong a bawl dan le a vanzahte tua bang ma hi ding a, kham, a dum, a dupsan, a ausan, a kop-a kihiaton vau hoite tawh a kigan puonte tawh kibawl hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Onyx suong ni la-in tua gel tungah Israel tapate’ min na giel ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />a suona utawh kizui-in suong khat tungah amau’ min guh teng gielin, a omlai guhte’ min pen suong dang khat tungah na giel ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Suong manpha at pa in khutsip a khuoh bangin tua suong nite tungah Israel tapate’ min khenkuohin na giel ding hi; kham tawh kibawl a geiviel sungah tuate na koi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Israel tapate phawna suong dingin siempu puon’ liengkaih puon tungah tua suong tegel na bul ding hi; Aaron in a liengko tegel tungah phawzing nadingin Topa mai-ah amau’ min puo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kham tawh kibawl a geiviel le
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />khauhuol banga kihuol, kham citah khainieng kipheh ni na bawl ding hi; a bulnate tungah a kihuol khainiengte na bul ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Siemnel tahin thukhenna awmdal khat na bawl ding ahi; siempu puonah a kibawl bangma-in na bawl ding hi; kham, a dum, a dupsan, a ausan, a kop-a kihiaton vau hoite tawh a kigan puonte tawh na bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua khu a kikim ning li nei-in thuop ni hi ding a, a dunglam khap khat, a vailam khap khat ma hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua sungah suong guol li-in na cieng ding hi. A guol masa, carnelian, chrysolite, le emerald suongte hi ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />a guol nina, turquoise, sapphire, le suongkangte hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A guol thumna, jacinth, agate, le amethyst suongte hi ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />a guol lina, beryl, onyx, le jasper suongte hi ding a, kham geiviel sungah kibul ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Israel tapate’ min tawh kituohin a min uh a kigielna suong sawm le ni om ding hi; tuate pen minam sawm le nite adinga a min ciet uh a kigielna khutsipte tawh kibang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A awmdal dingin khauhuol bangin kham citah khainieng kipheh na bawl ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />a awmdal dingin kham kuol ni na bawl ding a, awmdal mongte-ah tuate na bul ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Awmdal monga a kuol nite sungah kham khauhuol ni tegel na khum ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />khauhuol mong nite a bulna nite tawh na zom ding a, siempu puon’ liengkaih puon mai lamah tua bangin na zom ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Kham kuol ni bawlin, tua a kuol tegel awmdal mong ni, a sunglam mong kawnggah banah na bul ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Kham kuol ni na bawl ding a, siempu puon liengkaih ni tegel’ nei a mailam, hoitaha kigan siempu puonkhau a kizopna tung son ah na bul ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hoitaha kigan siempu puonkhau tungah a beh den thei nading le siempu puon tung panin awmdal a hlagin lo nadingin siempu puon kuolah khauhuol dum khat tawh kigahton ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tua ahi ciengin, Topa mai-ah phawzing nadingin a siengtho munah a pei ciengin, Aaron in a lungtang tunga om thukhenna awmdal sungah Israel tapate’ min puo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Thukhenna awmdal sungah Urim le Thummim na koi ding a, Topa mai-ah a pei ciengin Aaron’ lungtang tungah tuate om ding hi. Tua bangin Aaron in a lungtang tungah Israel-te’ thukhenna pen Topa mai-ah puo tawntung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Siempu puontuolpi pen puondum vive tawh na bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A laikimah lu khum nading a vang khat nei ding a, puon-ngawng banga a kike lo nadingin a ngawng vang kimvelah ki-aiha kai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Puontuolpi mong nei lam pen a dum, a dupsan, a ausan vaukhaute tawh a kizem mang kawlsing ga na bawl ding a, tuate kikalah kham sialawng na bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Puontuolpi mong kimvelah kham sialawng le mang kawlsing gate, a kikahhal dimdiemin a ban banin na khai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Aaron in siempu na a sep ciengin tua puon sil ding a, Topa mai a siengtho munah a tum cieng le a pusuo ciengin ama a si lo nadingin a ging kiza ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Kham citah tawh a peh khat na bawl ding a, khutsip tunga lai kigielte bangin tua tungah, “ Topa ading Siengtho,” ci-in na gielkuoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tua pen dielkhim tungah khauhuol dum khat tawh na khi ding hi; tua pen dielkhim mailamah om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tua pen Aaron’ talpang ah om ding a, Israel-te in letsong siengthote a piehna uh ahi, a siengtho silpieh ah khielna khatpo a op leh Aaron in lukhuh ding hi; Topa mai-ah amate a kisan thei nadingin a talpang vuah tua a peh om zing ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />A puon tungsil ding pen khau hoi tawh sih li nei, a pawlin na gan ding a, khau hoi tawh dielkhip khat zong bawlin hieu tawh a kikhui a kizem kawngga khat na bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Aaron’ tapate adingin puon tungsilte, kawnggahte, le lukhute na bawlpieh ding hi; thupina tawh a kidim nadingin tuate na bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Amate in keima kungah siempu na a sep thei nadingun na sanggampa Aaron le a tapate na silsah ding a, amate sathau nu-in na sem dingin kipsahin na siensuo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />A guoh vua a opna uh a khu dingin amate dingin puon hoi tawh bawngbi sungtente na bawlpieh ding hi; tuate in kawng panin phei cieng dong ban ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />kikhopna puonbuh sungah a pei cieng uh ahi a, a siengtho munah na sem dingin maitam nai-ah a pei ciengun ahi zongin, Aaron le a tapate in tuate sil ding uhi. Tua hi sihle amate in amau’ tung ma-ah mawna kisuontawm suohin si ding uhi. Tami pen ama le a nuasie a suonlehlahte adingin a om zing ngaina kip khat hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Amate in ka siempu na a sep thei nadingun a tung vuah siensuona tam bangin na bawl ding hi. Paubaang lo bawngtangno khat le tuutang ni,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />tol saw lo anlum, sathau kihal tol saw lo mohte, sathau tawh a kizut tol sawlo mophengte la in. Tuate pen mangbunel tawh na bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Law khat sungah tuate na koi ding a, a law tawh tawi-in bawngtang le tuutang ni zong na peipi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kikhopna puonbuh kotbiengah Aaron le a tapate na zawpi ding a, tui tawh amate na sil ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciengin puonte la-in, puon tungsil le siempu puontuolpi, siempu puon le awmdal, Aaron na silsah ding a, hoitaha kigan siempu puon gaana tawh ama na gah ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />a lu tungah diel na khimsah ding a, dielkhim tungah kumpi lukhu siengtho na khusah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nu sathau la-in a luzangah sungsuhin na nu ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ciengin a tapate zawpi-in puontungsil na silsah ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />kawnggahte tawh gahin, a lutung vuah lukhute na khusah ding hi; tawntung ngaina kip a omsa ma bangin siempu nasepna pen amau-a’ hi ding hi. Tua bangin Aaron le a tapate na sudet ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kikhopna puonbuh mai-ah bawngtang na peipi ding hi. Aaron le a tapate in bawngtang’ lu tungah a khut uh ngam ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa mai, kikhopna puonbuh lutna mai-ah tua bawngtang na go ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bawngtang si themkhat la-in na khutme tawh maitam kite tungah na nu ding a, a omlai a si teng zosie maitam zungah na sung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A gilpi tuom a thau zosie le a sin tuom a tepkai le a kal ni le a kal tuom a thaute la-in maitam tungah tuate na hal ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahi vangin bawngtang sa le a vun le a eehte, giephuol pu lamah mei tawh na hal ding hi; tua khu mawna zieha biehna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ciengin tuutangte khat la-in Aaron le a tapate in tuutang luzangah a khut a ngam ding vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />tuale tuami tuutang go-in a si la-in maitam kimvelah na the ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ciengin tuutang semnenin a sungkuo le a kengte na sawp sieng ding a, a sabate le a lu tawh tuate koitonin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />maitam tungah tuutang sa a unpi-in na hal ding hi; tua khu Topa tunga meihal biehna hi ahi a; a gimnamtui, Topa tunga mei tawh kihal biehna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuutang adang khat na la ding hi; tuale Aaron le a tapate in a luzangah a khut uh ngam ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />tua tuutang go-in a si them khat la-in Aaron’ zietlam bildawn, a tapate’ zietlam bildawn, amau’ zietlam khutpi dawn le amau’ zietlam kepi dawnte nu-in, a si omlai teng maitam apang zosie-ah na the ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ciengin maitam tunga om gansi themkhat le nu sathau themkhat la-in Aaron le a puonte tung le a tapate le a puonte tungah na the ding hi; tua ciengin ama le a puonte a siengtho hi ding a, a tapate le a tapa’ puonte zong a siengtho hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuutang thau, a mei thau, a sungkuo tuom a thau, a sin tunga beh a tepkai, a kalgel a tuom a thau, le a phei zietlam (azieh pen tua khu suhdetna tuutang ahi hi)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />le Topa mai-a om tol saw lo anlum law sung panin anlum khat, sathau tawh kibawl anlum beh khat, le mopheng khat na la ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />tam teng pen a unpi-in Aaron’ khutphang le a tapate’ khutphang tungah na koi ding a, Topa mai-ah a kivei biehna dingin tuate na lamto ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua ciengin a khut sung panun tuate na la ding a, Topa mai-ah a namtui dingin gimnamtui meihal biehna maitam tungah mei tawh na haltum ding hi. Tua khu Topa tunga mei tawh kihal biehna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Aaron suhdetna dinga kigo tuutang’ awmpheu la-in Topa mai-ah a kivei biehna-in na lamto ding hi; tua khu nangma’ tanh hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A kivei biehna dinga kilamto a awmpheu le suhdetna biehna tuutang pana Aaron le a tapate tanh ding ahi a kivei biehna dinga kilamto a mal na siensuo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tam teng pen Aaron le a tapate dinga Israel-te tung pana a kaih zing ding uh ahi hi, azieh pen tami khu biehna khat ahi hi; tua khu Israel-te in Topa tunga thunuom biehna dinga a pieh uh a biehpiehna uh pana biehna khat hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A siengtho Aaron’ puonsilte pen ama’ si nua ciengin a tapate kipie ding hi; tua puonte sungah amate sathau kinu-in kisudet ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ama’ siempu za a laih a tapa in siengtho munah na sem dingin kikhopna puonbuh ah a pei ciengin ni sagi sung tua puonte sil ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Suhdetna tuutang na la ding a, mun siengtho khatah a sa na huon ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Aaron le a tapate in kikhopna puonbuh lutna-ah tuutang sa le law sunga anlum ne ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Amate mama in kisuhdet nading le kisiensuo nadingin thoidamna an a ne ding vua, hizongle midangte in ne thei lo ding hi. Azieh pen tuate a siengtho ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Suhdetna sa ahi a, anlum ahi zongin zingmawng donga a op lai leh aval teng mei-ah na haltum ding hi; tua khu a siengtho ahi ziehin kine lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Kang thupiehsa bang lienin Aaron le a tapate tungah na bawl ding hi; ni sagi sung tungtawn amate na sudet ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Thoidamna bawl nadingin mawna zieha biehna-in bawngtang khat zong nisielin na pie ding hi. Thoidamna na bawl ciengin maitam adingin zong mawna zieha biehna na pie ding a, tuale maitam sathau nu-in na siensuo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Maitam adingin ni sagi sung thoidamna bawlin na siensuo ding a, tua maitam a siengtho pen hi ding hi; tua maitam a tham poma siengtho ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tu-in maitam tunga na pieh ding tam teng ahi hi: Nisielin kum khat a pha tuuno ni ta na pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Zingmawngin tuuno khat na pie ding a, nitah lamin adang tuuno khat na pie ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />tuuno a masa tawh olive thau kigawtvui hai khat’ seli-suo-sekhat tawh kihal annel law khat’ sesawm-suo-sekhat, le dawn thei biehna dingin lenggazu hai khat’ se li-suo-se khat hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Nitah lamin tuuno adang khat na pie ding a, zingmawnga bang ma-in a gimnamtui ding, Topa tungah mei tawh kihal biehna dingin an tawh biehna le dawn thei biehna na piehtha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tua khu na khang tawntung vua kikhopna puonbuh lutna Topa mai-a na bawl zing ding uh meihal biehna hi ding a, keima in khum munah hing kimupi-in kang holimpi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Khum munah Israel-te ka kimupi ding a, keima’ vang in khum mun ka siengthosah ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />kikhopna puonbuh le maitam ka siensuo ding hi; ka siempu na sem dingin Aaron le a tapate zong ka siensuo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Israel-te lahah ka teng ding a, amau’ Pasien ka hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Amate lahah ka ten thei nadingin Egypt gam pana a peipi pa Topa a Pasien uh ka hi lam amate in ei thei ding uhi; Keima amau’ Topa ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Gimnamtui hal nading maitam khat na bawl ding hi; tua khu gising tawh na bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Adung tong khat, avai tong khat hi ding hi; a kikim ning li nei hi ding a, a sanna tong ni hi ding hi; a kite maitam tawh sa khat suoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A tung le a pang kimkot zosie le a kite pen kham citah tawh na zut ding hi; a kimvelah kham geihuol na bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Maitam adingin kham kuol ni na bawl ding hi; a geihuol nei-a kigalsai a pang tuohah tuate bawlin tuate tawh maitam puo ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Gising tawh ciengzawlte na bawl ding a, kham tawh tuate na zut ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nangma tawh ka kituo nading mun, thuciemna tunga om hepina topha mai, thuciemna tunga om dalna puon mai-ah tua maitam na koi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aaron in tua tungah a tuinam gimnamtui a hal ding hi; ama in tua khu zingmawng sielin meivahte a tan ciengin a hal ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aaron in nitahin meivahte a koi ciengin tuate hal ding a, tua khu na khang tawntung vua Topa mai-a na hal zing ding uh gimnamtui biehna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua tungah a sieng lo gimnamtui hitale, meihal biehna hitale, an tawh biehna hitale na pie sih ding hi; tua tungah dawn thei biehna na sung sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuami maitam’ kite tungah Aaron in kum khatin khatvei ta thoidamna ngaina kip khat a bawl ding hi. Ama in na khang tungtawnun tuate adingin mawna zieha biehna si tawh kum khatin khatvei thoidamna bawl ding hi. Tua khu Topa tunga a siengtho pen ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa in Moses tam bangin a hopi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Israel-te mi phaza simin sazien na lah ciengin amate a kisim ziehin a tung vuah gimna a tun lo nadingin, min simna laibu a kibawl ciengin a luong man dingun Topa tungah a unpi-un kitatna pie ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Min simna-ah a mintuong tapo in a pieh ding tami ahi hi: biehinn shekel dung zui-in shekel lang (shekel khatah gerah sawmni om hi), Topa tungah biehna-in pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Min simna sunga kihal kum sawmni panin a tungsie poma in Topa tungah biehna pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na nuntah nading vua thoidamna bawl nadingin Topa tungah biehna na pieh ciengun, mihaute in shekel lang sangin a tamzaw a pie sih ding vua, mizawngte in a tawmzaw a pie tuon sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Israel-te kung panin thoidamna sum na la ding a, tua pen kikhopna puonbuh nasep nadingin na koi ding hi; tuami sum pen na nuntah nading vua kipie Israel-te’ kitatna sum ahi a, Israel-te adingin Topa mai-a phawsahna hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Topa in Moses tam bangin hopi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kisil nadingin sumngo kuong khat le a tunna sumngo khat ma na bawl ding hi. Tua khu kikhopna puonbuh le maitam kikalah na koi ding a, tuale a sungah tui na sung ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aaron le a tapate in tua tui tawh a khut ule a keng uh a sil ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kikhopna puonbuhah a pei cieng uh ahi a, Topa tungah mei tawh kihal biehna lui dinga maitam nai-ah a pei cieng uh ahi zongin, a si lo nadingun tui tawh kisilsieng ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A si lo nadingun amate in a khut ule a keng uh a sil ding uhi: Tua pen amate, Aaron, le a suon a hlahte dingin a khang tawntung vua a zui ding uh ngaina kip khat hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Topa in Moses tam bangin hopi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A hoipen a namtuite tam bangin la in: Myrrh gimnamtui shekel zanga le a namtui singgui thah tua za’ alang, shekel zani le sawmnga a gih, le a hlum a tuinam gimnamtui zani le sawmnga,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />biehinn shekel tawh kite, singgui thah nam khat zanga, le olive thau bung khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />le gimnamtui bawlte bawl ma bangin nu sathau siengtho dingin tamte na gawm ding hi; tua khu nu sathau siengtho hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Nangma in tua tawh kikhopna puonbuh le thuciemna singkuong,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />sabuoi le a vanzah zosie, meivah khuom le a vanzahte, le gimnamtui halna maitam,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />le meihalna maitam le vanzah zosie tawh, kuong le a tunna tawh na nu ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />tuate a siengtho pen ahi thei nadingin na siensuo ding a, tuate a tham kha poma siengtho ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Amate in ka siempu nasep a sep thei nadingun Aaron le a tapate sathau nu-in na siensuo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Israel-te kungah, “Tami khu na khang tawntung vua a siengtho keima’ nu sathau hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Mi maimaite’ pum tungah tua sathau kizang lo ding a, tua banga kigawm sathau dang na bawl sih ding uhi; tua khu a siengtho hi a, note dinga a siengtho ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tua tawh a kibangin a hal mi poma ahi a, a kilawm lo mi khatpo tungah a nupieh mi poma ahi zongin a mite lah panin kihemkhieding hi, Topa in ci hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Topa in Moses kungah tam bangin gen hi: A namtui nate, stacte, onycha, galbanum, gimnamtui tahtah tawh a namtui nate (a phaza kikim ciet) la inlen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />gimnamtui bawlte’ bawl bangin ci saw inlen a nieh baang lo biehna gimnamtui bawl in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />tuate kimkhat na gawtvui ding a, keima in kang kimupina ding mun kikhopna puonbuh sunga thuciemna’ mai-ah pawlkhat na koi ding hi; tua khu nang dinga a siengtho pen ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tam banga a kihalna dan tawh kizui-in gimnamtui na bawl ciengun note dingin na bawl sih ding uhi; tua khu Topa adingin a siengtho-in na ngaisun ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tua tawh kibanga gimnamtui a bawl poma a mipite lah panin kihemkhie ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Moses a hopi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />En in, keima in Judah minam Hur’ tapa ahi Uri’ tapa Bezalel khu a minin ka hlan zo ta hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pasien’ hlagau tawh ama ka kidimsah zo a, lim hoite a gel ding, kham, ngun, le sumngo tawh na a bawl ding, bul ding suong a kheng ding, singzep nasep a sem ding, le khutsiem nasep zosie a sem thei dingin siemna, pilna, le khutsiem nasep zosie sep theina ka pie zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua beh hi tham loin, Dan minam Ahisamach’ tapa Oholiab tawh ama ka seton ahi ta hi; keima in nang kang thupieh zosie amate in a bawl thei nadingun khutsiem mi zosie tungah zong siemna ka pie zo hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kikhopna puonbuh, thuciemna singkuong, a tunga om hepina topha, le puonbuh sunga na zosie,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />sabuoi le a vanzahte, a siengtho meivah tunna le a vanzah zosie, gimnamtui maitam,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />meihal biehna maitam le a vanzah zosie, kuong le a tunna,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />hoitaha kigan puonte, Aaron le a tapate in siempu na a sep cieng vua a sil ding uh puon siengthote,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />siengtho muna zah ding ahi nu sathau le a tuinam gimnamtuite bawl ding uhi. Keima in na kunga kang thupieh bang lienin amate in a bawl ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa in Moses kungah tam bangin a gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Israel-te kungah nangma ma in na gen ding hi: “Ka sabbath-te na tang ding uhi. Bangzieh ahei cile tam pen note ang siengthosah Topa ka hi lam na thei nadingun keima le no kikalah na khang tawntung vua lim khat hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sabbath na tang ding uhi, azieh pen note dingin tua ni khu a siengtho ahi a, tuami ni a buasah poma kithat ding hi; tuami ni-a na sem poma a mite lah panin kihemkhie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Niguh sungin nasep kiman ding hi. Hizongle a ni sagi ni pen a thupi tawlngahna sabbath ni khat hi a, Topa adingin a siengtho ahi hi; sabbath ni-in na khat a sem poma kithat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Israel-te in sabbath a kemcing ding vua, amate in a khang tawntung vua tawntung thuciemna-in tua sabbath a tang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tami pen keima le Israel-te kikalah lim khat hi zing ding hi. Ni guh sungin Topa in van le lei siem a, a ni sagi ni-in toi omin a tha dimkia hi, ci in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pasien in Sinai Muol tungah Moses a hopi zaw ciengin Pasien’ khutme tawh kigiel thuciemna suongpeh ni ama a pie hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Muol tung panin Moses a kumsuh ha lam mite in a thei ciengun Aaron kimvelah kikhawmin ama kungah, “Hing pei inlen, kote dingin ka mai vua pei ding pasien-te ei bawlpieh in; Egypt gam pan ei peipito pa Moses lah bang suoh ta ahei ka thei sih uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aaron in amate kungah, “Na zite, na tapate ule na tanute uh’ bil tunga a ba uh kham bilbate sutdawh unlen ka kungah tuate hing peipi un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaci’n mi zosie in a bil vua a ba uh kham bilbate a sutdawh vua, Aaron kungah tuate a peipi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in amate kung panin kham la-in sumtui sunna sungah a sung a, bawngno lim khat a bawlpieh hi; tuale amate in, “Israel aw, tamte khu Egypt leitang pana ang peipito na pasien-te uh ahi hi!” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aaron in tua a mu bepin a mai-ah maitam khat a lam hi; tuale Aaron in tangtawh a, “Zing cieng pen Topa ading pawi bawl ni hi ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zingmawngin amate tho bai-in meihal biehnate a lui vua, thunuom biehnate a peipi uhi; tuale anne tuidawn dingin mite a to vua, zu khamin numei le pasal guolnuomin a thangtat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa in Moses kungah, “Thakhatin kumsuh in! Egypt leitang pana na peitopi na mite a lelamin a gamta sieng ta uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />ka thupieh lampi panin amate a piel zuai ta uhi; amate dingin a kituisun bawngno lim khat bawlin tua tungah biehpiehna lui-in a bie vua, tuale ‘Israel aw, tamte khu Egypt leitang pana ang peipito na pasien-te uh ahi hi!’ ci uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa in Moses kungah, “Keima in tam mite bang zatahin ngawngkhauh ahi uh ahei ci ka mu zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Keima in amate tungah ka sinso-in ka manthaisah nadingin kei guohin ei omsah un. Nang na hi leh minam lien khatin kang bawl ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahi vangin Moses in Topa a Pasien kungah thum vangut a, “ Topa aw, nangma in na vanglietna le na banhat tawh Egypt leitang pana na peipi na mite tungah bang dingin sinso ding na hei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bang dingin Egypt-te in, ‘Muol tunga a tha ding le lei maitang pana a suhmaimang dinga ngaisutna gilo tawh amate a peipi hi bo,’ ci ding uh ahei? A zauhuoi na lungthahna panin kihei in; na lungsim khelin na mite tungah gimna tungsah vawt sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amate tungah nangma ma na kiciem a, ‘Na suon na hlahte van tunga aasi za-in tamsahin, ka ciemsa tam leitang zosie na suon na lahte tungah a unpi-in ka pie ding a, amate in tua leitang a luo zing ding uhi,’ ci-a na genna na nasemte Abraham, Isaac, le Israel hing phawh bo in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuale Topa a lungsim kikhelin a mite tunga a tunsah sawm sietna a tungsah nawn sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ciengin Moses kihei-in a khut sunga om thuciemna suongpeh ni, a pang langni tuoh, a nua le ama-a kigiel suongpehte tawi-in muol tung panin a kumsuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Suongpehte ahile Pasien’ bawl ahi a, suongpehte tunga kikhuoh laigielte zong khu Pasien’ laigiel ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Joshua in mite kiko gamlumna a zah ciengin Moses kungah, “Giephuol ah gal kidona aw ging hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hinanle ama in, “Tua khu a zote’ awging hi lo a, a lelte’ awging zong hi lo hi; kei zah pen mi guolnuomte’ kikona awging ahi bo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Giephuol nai a tun lien tahin ama in bawngno le lamvuikai mipite mu a, Moses a lungthah sengin a khut sung panin suongpehte a paimang a, muol bulah a tawkeh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama in a bawlsa uh bawngno la-in mei tawh hal a, gawtvui-in tui tungah thezah a, Israel-te in tua tui a dawnsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Moses in Aaron kungah, “A tung vua mawna lienpi na tunsah nadingin tam mite in na tungah bang ang bawl uh ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuale Aaron in, “Ka Topa aw, kilungsosah seng sin; sietna bawl ding mite a uh lam na theisa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amate in keima kungah, ‘Ka masang vua a pei ding pasien-te ei bawlpieh in; Egypt gam pana ei peipito tami Moses lah bang suoh ta ahei ka thei zo ta sih uhi,’ ei ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuaci’n keima in amate kungah, ‘Kham nei popo in hing sutdawh ta un!’ ka ci hi; tuaci’n amate in keima kungah tuate ei pie vua, mei sungah ka sep leh tami bawngno lim ang suoh hi bo!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Moses in mipite’ phengtatnate a mu bepin (azieh pen Aaron in a galte uh’ simmaw nuisat dingin amate a na phengtatsah hi),
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />giephuol tunkotah Moses ding a, “ Topa lamah koi teng na pang vuoi? Keima kungah hing pei un!” a ci leh ama kimvelah Levi’ tapate a unpi-un a kikhawm pai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuale ama in a kung vuah, “ Topa , Israel-te’ Pasien in, ‘No a koimapo in na pang vuah namsau kikuo ciet un! Giephuol cin tengah tunkot khat pan tunkot khatah kile kawikawi unlen, a koimapo in na sanggampa, na guolpa, le na vengpa that ciet un,’ ci hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Moses’ thupieh bangin Levi mite a gamta vua, khum ni-in mihing tul thum bang a si hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Moses in, “Tuni-in na tung vuah thupha ang tunsah thei nadingin note khat ciet in na tapa uh ahi a, na tanu uh ahi zongin na suplaw vua, Topa na sem dingin noma le noma na ki-ap uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A zing ni-in Moses in mite kung ah, “Mawna lienpi khat na bawl zo uhi. Hinanle Topa kungah tu-in ka peito ding a, na mawna ziehun thoidamna ka bawl kha thei ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuaci’n Topa kungah Moses kilekia a, “Ala, tam mite in mawna lienpi khat bawl zo uhi; amate adingin kham pasien-te bawl tawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ahi vangin tu-in a mawna uh maisah in, na maisah zawh sih ding leh nangma’ gielsa laibupi panin ka min ei phiet dawh ta’n,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ahi vangin Topa in Moses kungah, “Ka tunga ang maw poma ka laibu panin ka phiet ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ahi vangin tu-in pei inlen na kunga kang gensa munah mite peipi in; en in, na mai-ah ka vantungmi ang pei ding hi. Hizongle daantat ni ding ang tun ciengin a mawna ziehun amate ka daantat ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tua ciengin Aaron’ na bawlsa bawngno tungah amau’ gamtatnasate ziehin mite tungah Topa in pul natna a tungsah hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Moses kungah, “Nangma le Egypt gam pana na peitopi mite tawh pei-in tami mun nuasie unlen, Abraham, Isaac, le Jacob tungah, ‘Na suonlehlahte tungah ka pie ding hi,’ ci-a ka khapsa gamah pei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Keima in na masang vuah vantungmi khat ka sawl ding a, Canaan-te, Amor-te, Hit-te, ka notmang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bawngnawi le khuoizu luonna leitangah peito un; ahi vangin lamkalah hing thatgam kha ding ka hi ziehin na kung vuah kang peito sih ding hi. Azieh pen note mi ngawngkhauh na hi uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mite in tam bang kamkhauhte a zah ciengun kapin a mau vua, koima in kizepna puonte a sil sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Azieh pen Topa in, “Israel-te kungah, ‘Nohaw mi ngawngkhauhte na hi uhi; na lah vuah bano khat sung hing pei leng note kang thatgam ta ding uhi. Tuaci’n na kizepnate uh suodawh unlen, note bang hing law ding ka hei ci ka khensat ding hi,’ ci-in,” ci-a Moses kunga a gensa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ziehin Israel-te in Horeb Muol panin a kizepnate uh a suo sieng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Moses in puonbuh la-in giephuol pulam a gamla munah a lam thei zel hi; ama in tua pen kikhopna puonbuh, ci hi. Topa a sui tapo in giephuol pulama om kikhopna puonbuh lamah a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Puonbuh sungah Moses a pei sielin mi zosie a ding to vua, a milipin a puonbuh kotbieng ciet vuah dingin puonbuh sung a tum dongin Moses a kaihlit uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Puonbuh sungah Moses a lut ciengin meii khuompi tuol suhin puonbuh kotbiengah ding a, Topa tawh Moses a kiho hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Puonbuh kotbiengah meii khuom a din lam a mu bepun a puonbuh kotbieng vuah mite dingto-in a unpi-un a kun uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lawmta kiho bangin maitang kituo-in Topa in Moses a hopi zel hi. Tua ciengin giephuol lamah ama a kilekia hi; ahi vangin Nun’ tapa, a nasem tangval Joshua in puonbuh a nuasie sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Moses in Topa kungah, “En in, nangma in ka kungah, ‘Tam mite zawpito in,’ nei ci hi; ahi vangin kei tawh koi zawhton ding ahei, ci nei theisah sih hi. Hinanle nang in, ‘Na minin nang kang thei a, ka mai-ah maipha zong na mu zo hi,’ nei ci zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tu-in na muna-ah maipha nga zo ka hi leh, nangma kang thei nading le na muna-ah maipha ka nga thei nadingin na lampite ei lah in. Tam minam khu na mite a hina zong ngaisun bo in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama in, “Nangma tawh ka ompina zawhton ding a, toidamna kang pie ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuale ama in a kungah, “Na ompina in ei zawpi sih ding leh tam panin kote ei puoh da mai in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Azieh pen nang in nei zawpi sih mawh leh, keima le ka mite in nangma’ muna-ah maipha ka nga lam uh bangci kithei ding ahei? Tua bang danin leisiet maitanga mi zosie sung panin keima le na mite a tuom vilvel ka hi ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Topa in Moses kungah, “Nang ngetsa ngeingei ma kang bawlpieh ding hi; bangzieh ahei cile ka muna-ah maipha na nga zo ta a, na min tawh nang kang thei hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Moses in, “Kang thum hi, na vanglietna ei lah in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ama in, “Na mai-ah ka hoina zosie ka peisah ding a, na mai-ah keima’ min,’ Topa ’ ci-in ka phuongzah ding hi; tuale ka lungsiet nop mite ka lungsiet ding a, ka hepi nop mite ka hepi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama in, “Nangma in ka mai na mu thei sih ding hi; azieh pen kei ei mute koima a hing om lo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Topa in a ban zom a, “En in, ka kunga na din nading suong tungah mun khat om hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />keima’ minthanna vang in ang nawh laitahin suongpi pawhkeh kikalah nang kang koi ding a, kang kalsan masangsie ka khutin nang kang lie ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />tua ciengin ka khut ka ladawh ding a, ka tawkhi na mu ding hi; ahi vangin ka mai kimu lo ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Moses kungah, “A masa tawh a kibangin suongpeh ni sui inlen, na tawhkehsa amasa suongpehte tunga kigiel thute ma tua suongpehte tungah ka giel ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zingmawngin kithawi-in Sinai Muol tungah peito inlen, muol dawn khum mun keima kungah nang mama hing kilah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nangma tawh koima hing katosah sin len, muol tung zosie tengah koima hing omsah sin; tua muol mai-ah tuuhon hitale, bawnghon hitale gamtasah sin,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuaci’n Moses in a masa bangin suongpeh ni a sui hi; tuale zingmawngin ama thobai a, Topa thupiehsa bangin a khut sungah suongpeh ni tawi-in Sinai Muol tungah a kato hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Meii lahah Topa kumsuh a, ama tawh khum munah dingtonin a min, “ Topa ,” ci-in a pulah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama mai-ah Topa pei a, “ Topa , Topa , hepi siem le khuotuo siem Pasien, lungthah bailo-in itna kip le muonhuoina tawh a kidim,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />a khang tul khatna dongin itna kip nei-in, khielna, thupalsatna le mawna a ngaidam, hinanle mawna mawh maisah loin, pate’ khielna tate tung le tute tungah, khang thum khang li donga a thuh pa,” ci-in a pulah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuale Moses in leilam nga-in a lu naw kunsuhin a bie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama in, “Tu-in nangma muna-ah maipha ka nga leh Topa aw, kang thum hi, kote tawh Topa hing pei in. Tam mite ngawngkhauh minam ahi zongun ka khielna ule ka mawna uh ei ngaidam inlen, na gouluo dingin kote ei la in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama in tam bangci hi: Keima in thuciemna khat ka bawl hi. Nangma’ mite zosie mai-ah leitung muncin tenga a om minam khatpo tunga a kibawl ngai nai vawt lo na lamdangte ka bawl ding hi; amate lahah na tenna uh mi zosie in Topa’ nasepna a mu ding uhi; azieh pen note tunga ka sil bawl ding pen a zauhuoi mama ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuni-a kang thupieh khu zui in. En in, na mai-ah Amor-te, Canaan-te, Hit-te, Perez-te, Hiv-te, le Jebus-te ka notmang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na peina ding gama a teng mite tawh thuciemna na bawl khah lo nadingin kidawm in. Na bawl khah leh note dingin awna thang a suoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A maitamte uh na phel ding vua, a biehna songte uh kuoitawngin a siengtho a khuomte uh zong na satpua ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />(Pasien dang na bie sih ding hi. Azieh pen ama’ min Thangsie ahi Topa khu a thangsie Pasien ahi hi).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua gama teng mite tawh thuciemna na bawl sih ding hi. Bang ding ahei cile amate in a pasien-te utawh pahtatna bawlin a pasien-te uh kungah a kithoi ciengun amate lahah mi pawlkhat in ang hlan ding vua, a siemsa uh na ne kha ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na tapate uh’ zi dingin a tanute uh la-in, tuale a pasien-te utawh pahtatna a bawl a tanute un na tapate uh pen a pasien-te utawh ang pahtatsah kha ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A kisung pasien-te na bawl sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tolsaw lo anlum pawi na bawl ding uhi. Abib hla, a kisesa hun sung tengin kang thupieh bangin ni sagi sung tol saw lo anlum na ne ding uhi; bangzieh ahei cile note Abib hla sungin Egpyt panin na peikhie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Naubu a hong masa pen na ganhingte uh, bawng le tuu tacil apa zosie keima-a’ ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Laa a tacil tuuno khat tawh na tanh ding vua, na tat sih uleh a ngawng na hiatawng ding uhi. Na tacilte zosie uh na tanh ding uhi. Khut guoh tawh koima ka mai-ah hing kila lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ni guh sung na na sem ding vua, ahi vangin a ni sagi ni-in na tawlnga ding uhi; lohlaw hun le anlah hun sung na ngawnin na tawlnga ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nipikalte’ pawi, mangbu a tung masa pawi, le kumbei an kaikhop pawi na bawl ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Na pasalte a unpi-un Israel Pasien ahi Topa Pasien mai-ah kum khatin thumvei kilaa ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile na masang vuah minam dangte ka notmang ding a, na gamgi uh ka golkeh ding hi; Topa na Pasien uh mai-ah kum khatin thumvei a kilaa dingin na peito sungun koima in na leitang uh ang deigaw sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tol tawh ka biehpiehna sisan na pieton sih ding vua, zingmawng dongin peisan pawi biehpiehna kikoi lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Na leitang vua a pieng a gamasate lahah a tuituoh pen Topa na Pasien uh’ inn ah na peipi ding uhi. Api’ nawizu tawh keelno na huontha sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Topa in Moses kungah tam bangin gen hi: “Tam thute giel in; tam thute tawh kituohin nangma le Israel tawh thuciemna khat ka bawl zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Khum munah ni sawmli le zan sawmli sung Topa tawh Moses omton hi; ama an ne lo tuidawn loin a om hi. Tuale ama in suongpehte tungah thuciemna kammalte ahi thupieh sawmte a giel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Moses in a khut sungah thuciemna suongpeh ni tawi-in Sinai Muol tung pan a kumsuh ciengin, Pasien tawh ama a va kiho zo ziehin a maivun a tan lamtah Moses in a thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Aaron le Israel mi zosie in Moses a mu ciengun a maivun taang a, ama kungah a pei ngam sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ahi vangin Moses in amate hlan hi; tuale Aaron le mihon makaite zosie zong ama kungah a peikia vua, Moses in amate a hopi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tua zaw ciengin a nai-ah Israel-te zosie a pei vua, ama in Topa in Sinai Muol tunga ama kunga a gen zosie thupiehna-in amate tungah a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Moses in amate a hopi zaw ciengin maikhuna khat tawh a maitang a khu hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />ahi vangin Topa tawh holim dingin ama mai-ah Moses a tum sielin a pusuokia masangsie a maikhuna a ladawh hi; ama pusuohin Israel-te kungah ama tunga kipie thute a gen ciengin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Israel-te in Moses’ maivun taang mu uhi; tuale ama tawh kiho dinga a pei masangsie-in Moses in maikhuna tawh a mai a khukia hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Moses in Israel mihon zosie a khawm a, amate kungah thu a gen hi: Tam teng khu Topa in na bawl ding vua ang thupieh ahi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ni guh sungin nasep kiman ding a, hinanle a ni sagi ni-in Topa tungah a thupi tawlngahna sabbath siengtho na nei ding uhi. Khum ni-in na khat a sem poma kithat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sabbath ni-in na tenna uh mun zosie-ah mei na taw sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Moses in Israel mihon zosie tungah thu gen hi: Tami khu Topa ang thupieh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Note lah panin Topa tunga pieh ding biehna pie un; kiphalna lungtang a nei poma in Topa’ biehnate hing tawi uheh. Tuate pen: kham, ngun le sumngo,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />a dum, a dupsan, a ausan khaute le hoitaha kigan puon; keelmul,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />a san-a kibum tuutang vunte le savun hoite ; gising,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />meivah ading sathau, nu sathau le a tuinam dingin gimnamtuite,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />siempu puon le a awmdala bul dingin onyx suong le suong dangte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Note lahah siemna nei zosie hing pei-in a bawl ding uh Topa’ thupieh zosie pen: biehbuh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />a puonbuh le a tung khuna, a vankhainate le a khuompehte, a zawlte, a khuomte, le a tunnate;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />singkuong a zawlte tawh, hepina topha, le kotkhah puonkhai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />sabuoi a zawlte le a vanzah zosie tawh, le Ompina Anlum;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />mei tan nading meivah tunna zong, a vanzahte le a meivahte tawh, le meivah ding sathau;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />le panamtui maitam a zawlte tawh, nu sathau le a tuinam gimnamtuite le biehbuh kotbienga zah ding puonkhai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />meihal biehna maitam, sumngo sialen, a zawlte, a vanzahte zosie, kuong le a ngahna tawh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />buhtuol-a puonkhaite, a khuomte le a tunnate tawh, le buhtuol tunkot ading puonkhai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />biehbuh khetphimte, huong khetphimte, le a khauhuolte;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />mun siengtho sunga na sep cienga zah ding hoitaha kigan puonte, siempu Aaron le a tapate in siempu a sep cieng vua a sil ding uh puon siengthote ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ciengin Moses opna panin Israel mihon zosie a peikhie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuale a lungtang a sukha le piehnopna lungsim a nei poma a pei vua, kikhopna puonbuh le a nasep nading zosie, le puon siengthote-a zah dingin, Topa’ biehna a tawi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuaci’n piehnopna lungtang a nei zosie, numei pasal pei-in samkilte, bilbate, min gielna khutsipte, le khibate le kham vanzah kisiemna cinteng a peipi vua, a milipin Topa kungah kham biehna a puoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A dum, a dupsan, a ausan vauzamte, puon hoi, keelmul, a san-a kibum tuutang vunte, ahi sihle savun hoite ahi zongin a nei mi poma in tuate a tawi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ngun ahi a, sumngo ahi zongin, a pie zo tapo in Topa’ biehna-in tuate a peipi uhi; nasepna kimang thei ding gising nei zosie in zong a peipi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Numei khutsiem zosie in a khut utawh pat a heh vua, amate hehsa a dum, a dupsan, a ausan vauzamte le hoitaha kigan puonte a peipi uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />a khutsiemnate uh zah nopna lungtang a nei numei zosie in keelmul a gan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Makaite in siempu puon le awmdala bul dingin onyx suong le suong dangte a peipi vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />gimnamtui le meivaha thal ding sathau, nu sathau, le gimnamtuite a peipi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Topa in Moses tungtawnin sep dinga a thupiehsa nasep nadingin pieh nopna lungtang a nei Israel numei pasal zosie in Topa tungah nop thu-a biehna-in tuate a peipi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tua ciengin Moses in Israel-te kungah thu gen hi: En un, Topa in Judah minam, Hur’ tapa, Uri’ tapa Bezalel a minin hlan zo hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Topa in Pasien’ hlagau tawh ama kidimsah zo a, lim hoite a gel ding, kham, ngun, le sumngo tawh na a bawl ding, bul ding suong a seh ding, singzep nasep a sem ding, le khutsiem nasep zosie a sem thei dingin siemna, pilna, le khutsiemna zosie sep theina a pie zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Topa in ama le Dan minam Ahisamach’ tapa Oholiab tungah midangte hilsawn theina a pie zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ama in khutsiem nasep, gelsiem nasep, a dum, a dupsan, a ausan khaute le hoitaha kigan puon, ahi sihle puonzep siem nasep; siemgat siemna, le gelsiemna nasep ahi zongin nasep namkim a sem dingin a tung vuah siemna a guon hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bezalel le Oholiab le mun siengtho nasep khat popo a sem thei dinga Topa in siemna le theitelna a guot mi poma in Topa’ thupiehsa zosie tawh a kituohin sem ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua ciengin Moses in Bezalel le Oholiab le Topa in nasep siemna a guot mi, na sep nopna lungtang a nei mi vannuoi hlan hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />amate in Moses tung panin mun siengtho nasep nadinga Israel-te in nop thu-a a pieh uh biehnate a sang uhi. Zingmawng sielin ama kungah nop thu-a kipie biehnate a puoh den lai vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />tuaci’n a nasepna ciet panun mun siengtho nasep namkim a sem thei khutsiem zosie pei-in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Moses kungah, “ Topa in i sep ding vua ei sawl na i sep nadingin mipite in a kisam za sanga a tamzaw ei puoh uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaci’n Moses in thupie-in giephuol mun zosie ah, “Pasal ahi a, numei ahi zongin, mun siengtho adingin piehkhietna adang hing pieh da ta un,” ci-in tang kitawhsah hi. Tuaci’n a pieh ding uh mipite kihlo hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />azieh pen nasep nadingin a pieh uh nate valkhe ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nasem mite lah panin siemna a nei mi zosie in puondal sawm tawh biehbuh bawl uhi; tuate pen a kop-a kihiaton vau hoite tawh a kigan puon le a dum, a dupsan, a ausan khaute tawh kibawl a, khutsiem taha kibawl cherub-te tawh a zem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Dalna puonte tong sawmni le tong giet ciet sau a, tong li ciet gol hi; dalna puon zosie a golna kikim ciet hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama in dalna puon ngate khatlekhat khuituo a, adang dalna puon ngate zong khatlekhat ma a khuituo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A kikhuituo a masa dalna puon geita pen’ among gei guolah vaudum mel bilvangte bawl hi; tua ma bangin ama in a kikhuituo a nina dalna puon a geita pen’ among gei guolah zong tuate ma a bawl hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />ama in dalna puon khat tungah bilvang sawmnga bawl hi; a kikhuituo a nina dalna puon mongah zong bilvang sawmnga ma bawlin a bilvangte khatlekhat kimaingat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kham kuol sawmnga bawlin, ama in a kuolte tawh dalna puonte khatlekhat kimatsah hi; tuaci’n biehbuh buppi khat a suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama in biehbuh tung puonbuh khu nadingin keelmul tawh kibawl dalna puonte zong bawl hi; ama in dalna puon sawm le khat bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Khumi dalna puonte pen adung tong sawm thum ciet, avai tong li ciet pha hi; tua dalna puon sawm le khatte’ gol dan kikim ciet hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama in dalna puon ngate khatlekhat khuituo-in adang guhte zong khatlekhat ma a khuituo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A kikhuituo a masa dalna puon geita pen’ among gei guolah a bilvang sawmnga bawl a, ama in a kizoppi ding dalna puon gei-ah a bilvang sawmnga ma a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Puonbuh buppi khat a suo thei nadingin ama in tua puonbuh a kimatsah dingin sumngo kilna sawmnga a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Puonbuh adingin ama in a sana kibum tuutang vun le savun hoi tawh a pulam khuna khat a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ciengin biehbuh adingin ama in a kitungto ding gising khuompehte a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Khuompeh khat adung tong sawm, avai tong khat le khap ciet ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A bul nadingin khuompeh khat in a zang ni ta nei hi; ama in biehbuh khuompeh zosie adingin tami a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Biehbuh’ khuompehte ama in tam bangin a bawl hi: Leitaw lampang adingin khuompeh sawmni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />le khuompeh sawmnite zungah a tunna sawm li ngun tawh, a zang nite adingin khuompeh a masa zungah a tunna ni, khuompeh adang khat’ zungah adang nite adingin a tunna ni ma a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ama in biehbuh a pang nina lam, leilu lampanga khuompeh sawmnite le
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />ngun tawh a kibawl a tunna sawmli adingin khuompeh khatah a tunna ni, adang khuompeh khat zungah a tunna ni ma a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Nitumna lam, biehbuh nualam adingin ama in khuompeh guh a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Biehbuh nualam a ningte adingin ama in khuompeh ni zong a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuate a nei lamah kikah a, ahi vangin a kuol masa-ah a dawn kimat hi; ama in a ning nite adingin tua bangin ni a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ngun tawh kibawl a tunnate tawh khuompeh giet a om hi: A tunna sawm le guh omin khuompeh khat zungah a tunna ni ta a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ama in gising zawlte, biehbuh pang khatah khuompehte adingin zawl nga,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />biehbuh a pang lang khatah khuompehte adingin zawl nga, nitumna lam biehbuh sialam pangah khuompehte adingin zawl nga ma a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />A zawl a laita pen, khuompeh laikim dong a ban pen khu mong khat panin mong khat dong a pei suohsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ama in khuompehte kham tawh zutin zawlte a tu dingin kham tawh a kuolte bawl a, a zawlte kham tawh a zut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ama in a engdum, a dupsan, a ausan, a kop-a kihiaton vau hoite tawh a kigan dalna puon khat bawl a, ama in a kihoi bawl cherub-te tawh gattha-in zem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tua puon adingin gising tawh a kibawl khuompi li bawl a, ama in tuate kham tawh a zut hi; a vankhainate uh kham ahi a, ama in tua khuomte adingin ngun tawh kibawl a tunna li a sung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ama in puonbuh tunkot adingin a dum, a dupsan, a ausan vaute le hieu tawh kikhui-in a kizem, a kop-a kihiaton vau hoite tawh a kigan puon tawh kotkhah puonkhai khat le;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />a khuompi ngate a vankhainate tawh a bawl hi. Ama in kham tawh tuate’ luzepna zutin a gaanate kham ahi a, ahi vangin a tunna ngate sumngo ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bezalel in gising tawh singkuong bawl hi; tua pen adung tong ni le khap, avai tong khat le khap, a sanna tong khat le khap ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in kham citah tawh tua singkuong, a sung a puo zutin a kimvelah kham geihuol a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in a ning lite adingin kham kuol li, a pang khatah kuol ni, a pang langkhat adingin kuol ni ma a bul hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in gising singzawlte zong sui a, kham tawh tuate a zut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Singkuong puoh nadingin singkuong panga a kuolte sungah a zawlte siet hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in kham citah tawh hepina topha khat bawl hi; adung tong ni le khap, avai tong khat le khap ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in sehta tawh kikheng kham tawh Cherub ni bawl hi; hepina topha mong tuohah tuate gel a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cherub khat mong khatah, Cherub khat a mong langkhatah om hi; a mong nite-ah hepina topha tawh sakhatin cherub-te a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cherub-te in a hlate a tunglamah a zahto vua, a hlate utawh hepina topha liesuhin ama gel khatlekhat a kimaingat hi; cherub-te’ mai pen hepina topha lam kinga hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama in gising tawh sabuoi zong bawl a, adung tong ni, avai tong khat, a sanna tong khat le khap ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kham citah tawh tua sabuoi zut a, a kimvelah kham tawh a geihuol khat a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama in sabuoi kimvelah a vailam khutpeh cie a pha a zawlpeh khat bawl a, tua zawlpeh kimvelah kham geihuol khat a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua sabuoi adingin kham kuol li bawlin a ning li, a keng lite-ah a kuolte a gah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sabuoi zawn nading zawltangte a tu dingin a zawlpeh gei-ah a kuolte om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sabuoi zawn nadingin gising singzawlte bawl a, kham tawh tuate zut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama in gimnamtui adingin sabuoi tunga vanzah ding kuongdaite, pakante, le dawnthei biehna sun nading kuongkumte, le thawlte kham citah tawh a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama in kham citah tawh meivah tunna khat zong a bawl hi. Meivah khuombul le a kungte sehta tawh kikheng ahi hi; a haite, a nunte le a papete tua meivah tunna tawh a kisamat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuale a pangte panin ba guh mengsawn a, pang khatah meivah tunna ba thum mengin, a pang lang khatah meivah tunna ba thum ma a meng hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />ba khat ciet tungah a nun le a pape a om, almond ga tawh a kibang hai thum, le adang ba khat ciet tungah a nun le a pape a om, almond ga tawh a kibang hai thum ma kibawl hi. Tuaci’n ba guhte meivah tunna panin a mengsawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A meivah tunna tung mama-ah a nunte le a papete tawh a om, almond ga tawh a kibang hai li om a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />meivah tunna panin ba guh a kopte’ bulah tua tawh sa khat ahi a nun khat om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A nunte le a bate kisamat a, a unpi-in sehta tawh kikhengsa kham citah ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Meivah sagite le a taitete le a kuongte kham citah tawh kibawl ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ama in meivah tunna le vanzahte zosie kham citah talent khat tawh a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ama in gising tawh adung tong khat, avai tong khat a pha gimnamtui maitam bawl hi; tua maitam in a kikim ning li nei a, a sanna tong ni pha hi; a kite pen tua maitam tawh kisamat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ama in a tungzang, a kimvelah a pangte le a kite kham citah tawh a zut hi; tuale a kimvelah kham geihuol khat
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />le a zawn nading ciengzawlte a tu dingin a pang tuoh a geihuol nei-ah kham kuol ni a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ama in gising tawh ciengzawlte sui-a, kham tawh tuate a zut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ama in gimnamtui bawlte’ bawl ma bangin nu sathau siengtho le a siengtho a namtui ahi gimnamtui zong a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ama in adung tong nga, avai tong nga a pha maitam khat gising tawh a bawl hi; tua pen a ning li kikim hi a, a sanna tong tong thum pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua maitam’ ning lite tungah a kite bawl hi; a kite maitam tawh kicimat a, sumngo tawh tuate zut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in vut khol nading beelte, kawbiate, kuongte, siakate, le vutluona pehte bawl a, maitam vanzahte zosie sumngo tawh bawl hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Maitam adingin a zawl nei-ah maitam kimcieng a bansuh, len banga kiphan, sumngo sia-len khat a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama in a zawlte tu dingin sumngo sialen ninglite tungah a kuol li a sung hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />ama in maitam adingin gising zawlte bawlin tuate sumngo tawh a zut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A puoh nadingin maitam pangte-a om a kuolte sungah a zawlte heng hi; ama in singpehte tawh maitam a lai hawmsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama in kikhopna puonbuh tunkotah na sem numeite’ hlimlangte panin sumngo tawh kisilna kuong le a tunna a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama in buhtuol a bawl a, leitaw lampang buhtuol puon kikhaite pen a kop-a kihiaton vau hoite tawh a kigan puon tawh kibawl a, tong zakhat a sau hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />a khuompi sawm ni le a tunna sawmni te pen sumngo tawh kibawl a, ahi vangin khuompi tunga vankhainate le a ganate pen ngun ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Leilu lampang a kikhaisuh dalna puon tong zakhat pha hi; a khuompi sawmni le a tunna sawmni te sumngo tawh kibawl ahi hi, ahi vangin khuompi tunga vankhainate le a ganate ngun ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nitumna lampang a kikhaisuh dalna puon tong sawmnga hi a, khuompi sawm hi-in, a tunna sawm ma ahi hi; khuompi-a vankhainate le a ganate ngun ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A mailam, nisuona lam manaw zong tong sawmnga ma ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kotpi pang khat a kikhaisuh dalna puon tong sawm le nga ahi a, khuompi thum le a tunna thumte tawh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A pang langkhat ading zong tu bang ma ahi hi; buhtuol lutna kotkhah a pang langkhat cietah a kikhaisuh dalna puon pen tong sawm le nga hi a, khuompi thum le a tunna thum tawh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Buhtuol kimvela puon kikhaisuhte zosie pen a kop-a kihiaton vau hoite tawh a kigan puonte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khuompi adingin a tunna sumngo hi a, ahi vangin a vankhainate le a ganate ngun ahi hi. Khuom luzum tuomnate’ kizutna khu ngun ahi a, buhtuol khuompi zosie ngun gaana tawh kigah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Buhtuol lutna puonkhai pen a dum, a dupsan, a ausan, a kop-a kihiaton vau hoite tawh a kigan puonte ahi a, hieu tawh kikhui-in kizem hi. Buhtuol-a kikhaisuhte tawh kizui-in tong sawmni sau-in, a vailam tong nga sau hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Khuompi li le a tunna lite sumngo tawh kibawl a, a vankhainate ngun hi-in, khuom luzum tuomnate le a gaanate’ kizutna khu ngun ma ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Biehbuh le buhtuol kimvel adingin khetphim zosie sumngo tawh kibawl ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tam teng pen siempu Aaron’ tapa Ithamar makaina nei-ah Levi-te’ sep ding biehbuh ahi thuciemna biehbuh ciemtena sazien ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Topa in Moses a thupieh zosie Judah minam Hur’ tapa, Uri’ tapa Bezalel in a sem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ama tawh a semton pen Dan minam, Ahisamach’ tapa Oholiab kici pa ahi a, ama pen suongkhuoh a siem, a etlawm sil suhtuo siem, a dum, a dupsan, a ausan vaute le hoitaha kigan puon hoite a zep siem mi khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nasep nadinga kizang kham zosie, biehbuh lamna-a kizang, le a kipie khamte, biehinn shekel-in talent sawmni le kuo le shekel za sagi sawmthum pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mi simna sunga kihal mihonte kung panin a kinga ngunte, biehna shekel-in talent zakhat le shekel tulkhat za sagi sawm sagi le nga a hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mi khat in beka khat ta (biehinn shekel-in shekel lang) pie a, a pie mi, kum sawmni panin a tungsie mi simna-a kisim poma tul zaguh le tulthum le zanga le sawmnga pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ngun talent zakhat pen biehbuh khuom tunnate le dalna puon khuom tunnate dinga kisung ding ahi hi. A tunna zakhat ading talent zakhat ahi a, a tunna khat ciengin talent khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Shekel tulkhat zasagi sawmsagi le nga lah panin khuompite tungah vankhaina-in bawl a, a khuom luzum tuomnate zutin tuate adingin a gaana a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A kipie sumngo pen talent sawmsagi le shekel tulni le zali ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />tua tawh ama in kikhopna puonbuh lutna tunkotte adingin khuom tunnate, sumngo maitam, sumngo sialen le maitam vanzah zosie,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />buhtuol kimvela khuom tunnate, buhtuol lutna tunkot’ khuom tunna te, biehbuh’ khetphim zosie le buhtuol kimvela khetphim zosie a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Siengtho muna nasep nadingin amate in a dum, a dupsan, a ausan vauzamte tawh a kilimgat puon a bawl uhi; Topa in Moses a thupiehsa bangin Aaron adingin puonsil siengthote a gatpieh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in kham, a dum, a dupsan, a ausan vaute le a kop-a kihiaton vau hoite tawh a kigan puonte tawh siempu puon a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A dum, a dupsan, a ausan tuumul vauzamte le a kop-a kihiaton vau hoite tawh a kigan puonte, siemnel taha a kizep nadingin, khampehte a pa dihdehin kisehin, a themthemin khauzamin ki-atsan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate in siempu puon dingin liengkaih puon bawlin among nite gelah a zom uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa in Moses a thupiehsa bangin a kiga nadingin a kilimgat tua tunga puon om pen kham, a dum, a dupsan, a ausan tuumulte, vaute le a kop-a kihiaton vau hoite tawh a kigan puonte tawh kibawl hi; a vanzahte le a sep dan pen a kibang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Israel tapate phaza tawh kizui-in onyx suongte kitat a, tua suongte tunga khutsip tungah min a kikhetkuoh bangin minte kikhenkuoh a, tuaci’n kham tawh kibawl a zepna sungah kikoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa in Moses a thupiehsa bangin ama in Israel tapate phawna suong dingin siempu puon’ liengkaih puon tungah tua suong tegel bul hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama in siempu puon bangin kham, a dum, a dupsan, a ausan tuumul khaute le a kop-a kihiaton vau hoite tawh a kigan puonte tawh siemnel tahin awmdal a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua awmdal in a kikim ning li nei a, tua awmdal pen thuop ni-in kibawlin adung khap khat, avai khap khat pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amate in tuami sungah suong guol li-in a cieng vua, a guol masa pen carnelian , chrysolite, le emerald suongte ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />a guol nina pen turquoise, sapphire, le suongkang zolte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A guol thumna pen jacinth, agate, le amethyst suongte ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />a guol lina pen beryl, onyx, le jasper suongte ahi hi. Kham tawh kibawl a zepna sungah tuate kikoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Israel tapate’ min tawh kituohin a minte uh a kigielna suong sawm le ni om hi; tuate pen khutsip tunga min gielna tawh a kibang a, minam sawm le nite adingin a min ciet uh kigiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amate in awmdal adingin khauhuol tawh a kibang a kihuol kham citah khainieng a bawl uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />tuale awmdal adingin kham a zepna ni le kham kuol ni bawlin awmdal’ mongte ah tua kham kuol ni a koi uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />tuale amate in awmdal’ mongte-a kikoi kham kuol nite sungah kham khauhuol ni tegel a khum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amate in a zepna ni tegel tungah khauhuol mong nite a zom uhi; tua bangin siempu puonah liengkaih puon masang lamah a bul uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate in kham kuol ni a bawl vua, khum tegel pen siempu puon tawh a kizom a sunglam gei, awmdal mong ni gelah a vaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amate in kham kuol ni a bawl vua, siempu puon liengkaih ni tegel nei a mailam, a kihoi gat siempu puonkhau a kizopna tung sonah a vaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Topa in Moses a thupiehsa bangin, hoitaha kigan siempu puon khau tungah a beh den thei nading le siempu puon tung panin awmdal a hlagin lo nadingin siempu puon kuolte ah khauhuol dum khatin a gah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ama in vaudum beh tawh a kigan siempu puontuolpi zong bawl hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />puon gawlan kihong bangin puontuolpi laikimah a vang om a, a kikee lo nadingin tua a vang kimkotah ki-aiha kai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Amate in a mongah a dum, a dupsan, a ausan vaukhaute le a kop-a kihiaton vau hoite tawh a kigan puonte tawh kizem mang kawlsing gate a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Topa in Moses a thupiehsa bangin kham citah sialawngte zong a bawl vua, puontuolpi mong kimvela mang kawlsing gate kikalah tua sialawngte a koi uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />siempu nasep nadingin puontuolpi mong kimvelah sialawng khat le mang kawlsing ga khat, khat zaw khat kikahhal diemdiemin a ban banin kikhai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Topa in Moses a thupiehsa bangin amate in Aaron le a tapate adingin khau hoi tawh kigan puontungsilte
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />le khau hoi tawh kigan lukhute, hoitaha kigan puon hoite tawh kibawl bawngbi sungten hoite,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />le a kop-a kihiaton vau hoite tawh a kigan puonte tawh a kibawl kawnggah le hieu tawh kizem a dum, a dupsan, a ausan puonte zong a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Amate in kumpi lukhu siengtho adingin kham siengtho a peh khat a bawl vua, khutsip tunga lai kigielte bang ma-in tua tungah, “ Topa dinga ki siensuosa,” kici laiteng a gielkuoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Topa in Moses a thupiehsa bangin amate in dielkhim tungah khauhuol dum khat tawh a khi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tam bangin kikhopna puonbuh ahi biehbuh nasep zosie kimansieng hi; Israel-te in Topa’ thupiehsa bang lienin a sem sieng zo ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate in biehbuh, a puonbuh le a vanzah zosie, a vankhainate, khuompehte, a zawlte, a khuompite le a tunna te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />a sana kibum tuutang vunte le savun nemte tawh a kibawl a tungkhu le kot puonkhai dalna puon;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />thuciemna singkuong, a zawlte le hepina topha tawh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />sabuoi le a vanzah zosie, le Ompina Anlum;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />meivah kibulsa kham meivah tunna le a vanzahte zosie le a kivah ding sathau;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />kham maitam, nu sathau le a tuinam gimnamtuite le puonbuh kotbieng adingin puonkhai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />sumngo maitam le sumngo sialen, a zawlte le a vanzah zosie; kisilna kuong le a ngahna;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />buh tuola puon kikhaite, a khuompite, a tunnate le buhtuol tunkot puonkhai, a khauhuolte le a khetphimte; kikhopna puonbuh ahi biehbuh nasepna kizang van zosie;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />siempu nasepna dinga a siengtho muna kizang ding hoitaha kigan puonte, siempu Aaron ading biehna puon siengtho le a tapate’ puonte, Moses kungah a tawi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Israel-te in Topa’ thupiehsa bang lienin na zosie a sem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Moses in nasep zosie van a, Topa’ thupieh bang lienin amate in nasep a zawsieng lam uh a mu ciengin amate thupha a pie hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Moses kungah tam bangin a gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hla masa a ni masa ni-in kikhopna puonbuh ahi biehbuh na lam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua sungah thuciemna singkuong koi-in, dalna puon tawh singkuong na dal ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A sungah sabuoi na tumpi ding a, a om dan ding bangin na koi ding hi. Meivah tunna zong a sungah tumpi-in a meivahte na bul ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thuciemna singkuong mai-ah gimnamtui hal nadingin kham maitam na koi ding a, biehbuh lutna adingin kotpuonkhai na khai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kikhopna puonbuh ahi biehbuh lutna mai-ah meihal biehna maitam na daw ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />kikhopna puonbuh le maitam kikalah kisilna kuong koi-in, a sungah tui na sung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A kimvelah buhtuol na bawl ding a, buhtuol tunkotah kotpuonkhai na khai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ciengin nu sathau la-in, biehbuh le a sunga om zosie nu-in biehbuh le a sunga om zosie na siensuo ding hi. Tuaci’n biehbuh a siengtho ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Meihal biehna maitam le a sunga vanzah zosie zong sathau nu-in na siensuo ding a, tua maitam a siengtho pen hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kisilna kuong le a ngahna zong sathau nu-in na siensuo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ciengin kikhopna puonbuh lutna-ah Aaron le a tapate zawpi-in, tui tawh amate na sil ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aaron in ka siempu na a sep thei nadingin ama puon siengthote silsahin, sathau siengtho nu-in na siensuo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A tapate zong zawpi-in puontungsilte na silsah ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />amate in ka siempu na a sep thei nadingun a pa uh sathau na nu bangin amate zong na nu ding hi: Sathau a kinu ziehun a khantanun siempu ahi peisuoh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa in ama a thupiehsa bang lienin Moses in sil bangkim a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A kum nina a hla masa, a ni masa ni-in biehbuh kidingsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Moses in biehbuh dingsah hi; a tunnate pha-in a khuompehte phut a, tuale a zawlte khumin a khuompite phut hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />tuale ama in biehbuh tungah a tungkhu puon zah a, tuaci’n Topa in Moses a thupiehsa bangin puonbuh tung a khu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Topa in Moses a thupiehsa bangin ama in thuciemna la-in singkuong sungah koi a, singkuong tungah a zawlte hlungin tua singkuong tungah hepina topha koi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama in biehbuh sungah singkuong peipi a, kotpuonkhai dalna puon khai suhin thuciemna singkuong a dalbih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Topa in Moses a thupiehsa bangin, ama in biehbuh leilu lampang, dalna puon puolam, kikhopna puonbuh sungah sabuoi pha a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Topa mai tua sabuoi tungah anlum a koi ding dan bangin a koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ama in kikhopna puonbuh sung, biehbuh leitaw lam pang sabuoi tawh kigalsai-in meivah tunna koi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Topa in Moses a thupiehsa bangin ama in Topa mai-ah meivahte a tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Topa in Moses a thupiehsa bangin ama in kikhopna puonbuh sung, dalna puon mai-ah kham maitam tung a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />tua tungah a tuinam gimnamtui biehna a halvam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ama in biehbuh lutna adingin kot puonkhai zong a khai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Topa in Moses a thupiehsa bangin ama in kikhopna puonbuh ahi biehbuh lutna-ah meihal biehna maitam tung a, tua tungah meihal biehna le an tawh biehnate a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ama in kikhopna puonbuh le maitam kikalah kisilna kuong koi a, a sungah kisil nading tui koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua tui tawh Moses le Aaron le a tapate in a khut ule a kengte a sil uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Topa in Moses a thupiehsa bangin kikhopna puonbuh a tum cieng ule maitam lam a neh ciengun a kisil uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ama in biehbuh kimvelah a buhtuol bawl a, tuaci’n buhtuolah kotpuonkhai a khai hi. Tuaci’n Moses nasep a man sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tua ciengin meii in kikhopna puonbuh tuomin biehbuh sungah Topa’ minthanna a dim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Kikhopna puonbuh meii in a tuomcip ziehin a sungah Moses a lut thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />A khuolzin sung tungtawn uh biehbuh tung panin meiilum a kilahto popo ciengin Israel-te in ma nawhin a pei uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />ahi vangin meiilum a kilahto sih leh a kilahto masangsie-in ma a nawh sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Azieh pen a khuol zinna tungtawn vuah Israel innkuonte zosie’ mitmu-in biehbuh tungah sunin Topa’ meii om a, zanin meii lahah meikuongin a om hi.
  </para>
</usx>
